A '''crafting stall''' is a type of [[stall]] that can be stolen from at level 5 [[Thieving]], granting 20 Thieving [[experience]]. They contain [[chisel]]s, [[ring mould]]s, and other [[Crafting]] materials. [[Jamila's Craft Stall.|Jamila's Craft Stall]] in [[Sophanem]] cannot be stolen from.

In [[Marim]], it is possible to steal from the crafting stall while in line of sight of the shop owner. Furthermore, after stealing from the store, the shop owner will still trade with the player, instead of calling for guards. Neither statement is true for the stall in [[Keldagrim]].

