{{External|rs}} {{Confuse|oak workbench}} {{Infobox Construction |name = Crafting table 1 |image = [[File:Crafting table 1 built.png|250px]] |icon = [[File:Crafting table 1 icon.png]] |furniturename = Clockmaker's bench |release = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |update = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |level = 16 |experience = 240 |room = [[Workshop]] |hotspot = [[Clockmaking space]] |flatpack = No |examine = You can do delicate crafting here. |id = 6796 |itemid = 8380 }} A '''crafting table 1''' can be built in the [[clockmaking space]] of the [[workshop]] in a [[player-owned house]]. It requires 16 [[Construction]] to build, granting 240 [[experience]]. The player must have a [[hammer]] and a [[saw]] in their inventory to build it.
Players gain [[Crafting]] experience for making the items on the table rather than Construction experience.
