A '''crane''' is found on the {{FloorNumber|uk=1}} of the [[Fishing Platform]]. After kicking down the [[badly repaired wall]] during the [[Sea Slug]] [[quest]], players must rotate the crane which initiates a cutscene where they lower [[Kennith]] to the platform below.
Once the cutscene is completed, players are not able to rotate the crane, providing a message saying: {{Mes|Maybe I shouldn't be playing with that...}}
{{Sea Slug}}

