A crashed star produces one [[stardust]] on every successful mining attempt. A player with an active discovery bonus also receives an extra stardust, until they have received 300 extra.
{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Misthalin,Karamja,Asgarnia,Fremennik,Kandarin,Desert,Morytania,Tirannwn,Wilderness,Kourend,Varlamore}} {{DropsLineSkill|name=Stardust|quantity=1,2|rarity=Always|skill=Mining}} {{DropsTableBottom}}
