{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Crate |image = [[File:Crate (In Aid of the Myreque).png]] |release = [[22 March]] [[2006]] |update = In Aid of the Myreque |members = Yes |quest = [[In Aid of the Myreque]] |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Search, Destroy |destroy = You can get another crate by talking to the store owner in Burgh de Rott. |examine = An old and musty looking crate. |value = 1 |weight = 10.000 |id = 7630 }} [[File:Crate (In Aid of the Myreque) detail.png|left|130px]] The '''crate''' is an item that players use while doing the [[In Aid of the Myreque]] quest, specifically while restocking the [[general store]] in [[Burgh de Rott]]. It is obtained from [[Aurel]] to hold the items he requires. Those items are ten [[bronze axe]]s, ten [[raw mackerel]] or raw [[snail]]s and three [[tinderbox]]es.
Despite having a destroy option, it can be placed on a table.
