The '''crate''' is the entrance to the southern part of the [[Temple of Marimbo Dungeon]] where the player finds the [[M'amulet mould]] during [[Monkey Madness I]]. Upon searching the crate the player will be prompted with: {{Cquote2|You find a hole in the floor under the crate! All you can see is the faint glimmer of extremely far below.}} If they then choose to go down the player will be prompted with: {{Cquote2|You begin to lower yourself into the hole...}} which results in either safely landing or taking fall damage equal to 32.9% of their current [[Hitpoints]]. Safely landing depends on the player's [[Agility]] level and results in the following message: {{Cquote2|... and using your catlike agility land on all fours at the bottom of a large cavern!}} The exact formula for fall damage is: <math>\left\lfloor \frac{26}{79} \text{Hitpoints} \right\rfloor</math>

