{{Infobox Item |version1 = Aldarin |version2 = Etceteria |version3 = Rellekka |name = Crate of adamantite ore |image1 = [[File:Crate of adamantite ore (Aldarin).png]] |image2 = [[File:Crate of adamantite ore (Etceteria).png]] |image3 = [[File:Crate of adamantite ore (Rellekka).png]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |bankable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine1 = A cargo crate of adamantite ore destined for Aldarin. |examine2 = A cargo crate of adamantite ore destined for Etceteria. |examine3 = A cargo crate of adamantite ore destined for Rellekka. |value = 0 |alchable = No |weight = 1.285 |id1 = 32435 |id2 = 32550 |id3 = 32734 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Crate of adamantite ore (Aldarin) detail.png|150px|left]] |version2 = [[File:Crate of adamantite ore (Etceteria) detail.png|150px|left]] |version3 = [[File:Crate of adamantite ore (Rellekka) detail.png|150px|left]] }} A '''crate of adamantite ore''' is an item that may be obtained from a [[ledger table]] after taking on a [[courier task]], which must then be delivered to the corresponding destination's port by boarding their [[boat]] and sailing to said destination. Players without a crewmate to navigate their boat must store the crate in the [[cargo hold]] before they can man the helm.
Multiple of a crate may be required to be delivered for a courier task, in which case players must board their boat multiple times to store the crates (as they can only carry one at a time) or have a [[crewmate]] assist them, who will automatically take a crate when the player does so. While any crewmate can carry a crate, those with Deckhandiness levels of at least 3 can carry two at once.
Players cannot unequip the crate normally, nor can they teleport or leave the port area with the crate equipped. If the player leaves the area, a game message appears stating {{mes|You're leaving port with some cargo. If you do not return it, it will be confiscated by the shipwright wizard's autonomous tracking unit.|colour=#ff3045}} After 22 ticks (13.2s), the crate will be removed with an accompanying game message stating {{mes|Your cargo has been confiscated by the S.W.A.T. team.|colour=#ff0000}}
