A '''crate of crowbars''' is found nearby [['Squawking' Steve Beanie]] after delivering him the [[Crate of pirate looty]] and helping him create a "special key" during the quest, [[Prying Times]]. Players can retrieve infinite [[crowbar]]s from the crate to open other [[sealed crate]]s nearby. Before progressing far enough in the quest, some [[Sacks (Prying Times)|sacks]] can be found where the crate is.

