==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 17 December 2025 |update = More Sailing and Interface Changes |change = An additional variant of the Deepfin Point crate has been added to address an issue in which players could not take on a courier task that uses the same type of crate as an accepted task. Some crates and tasks were cleared as part of this change. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
{{Port tasks}}

{{Infobox Item |name = Crate of feathers |image = [[File:Crate of feathers.png]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = A cargo crate of feathers destined for Catherby. |value = 0 |alchable = No |weight = 1.285 |id = 32484 }} [[File:Crate of feathers detail.png|150px|left]] A '''crate of feathers''' is an item that may be obtained from a [[ledger table]] after taking on a [[courier task]], which must then be delivered to the corresponding destination's port by boarding their [[boat]] and sailing to said destination. Players without a crewmate to navigate their boat must store the crate in the [[cargo hold]] before they can man the helm.
Multiple of a crate may be required to be delivered for a courier task, in which case players must board their boat multiple times to store the crates (as they can only carry one at a time) or have a [[crewmate]] assist them, who will automatically take a crate when the player does so. While any crewmate can carry a crate, those with Deckhandiness levels of at least 3 can carry two at once.
Players cannot unequip the crate normally, nor can they teleport or leave the port area with the crate equipped. If the player leaves the area, a game message appears stating {{mes|You're leaving port with some cargo. If you do not return it, it will be confiscated by the shipwright wizard's autonomous tracking unit.|colour=#ff3045}} After 22 ticks (13.2s), the crate will be removed with an accompanying game message stating {{mes|Your cargo has been confiscated by the S.W.A.T. team.|colour=#ff0000}}
