==Trivia== *Upon release, Craw's bow had a starting [[Grand Exchange]] price of {{NoCoins|10,000,000|c}}. This was manually adjusted to {{NoCoins|100,000,000|c}} on [[1 August]] after frequent [[scams#4 noted items|luring]] in the Wilderness via dropping items whose prices on the Grand Exchange were more than the bow itself. As the game prioritises the protection of items that have the highest price on the Grand Exchange, the player may end up losing the bow by picking up an item worth slightly more than the bow on the Grand Exchange, which was worth around {{NoCoins|360,000,000|c}} at the time.
