{{External|rs=Crawling hand (item)}} {{Infobox Item |name = Crawling hand |image = [[File:Crawling hand (item).png]] |release = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |update = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = I should get it stuffed! |value = 1000 |weight = 10.000 |id = 7975 |leagueRegion = Morytania }} [[File:Crawling hand (item) detail.png|left|140px]] A '''crawling hand''' is a rare drop from [[Crawling Hand]]s, requiring 5 [[Slayer]] to kill. It can be stuffed at the [[Taxidermist]] in [[Canifis]] by using the item on her and paying 1,000 coins, returning a [[stuffed crawling hand]]. When players take it to her, she will tell players ''"That's a very fine crawling hand."''
Once stuffed, it can be [[Crawling hand (mounted)|mounted]] at a [[Teak display (head trophy)|teak]], [[Mahogany display (head trophy)|mahogany]], or [[gilded display]] within the [[skill hall]] in a [[player-owned house]], granting 31 [[Construction]] and 261 [[Slayer]] [[experience]].
The hand can alternatively be sacrificed to the [[Dark Altar]] north of [[Arceuus]], granting 2,500 [[Prayer]] experience.
