One quote is said every time Bellock attacks the player.
*"''I'm Bellock - respect me!''"
*"''Get off my site!''"
*"''No-one messes with Bellock's dig!''"
*"''These ruins are mine!''"
*"''Taste my knowledge!''"
*"''You belong in a museum!''"
*"''Rain of knowledge!''" - when using special attack
*"''Ow!''" - upon death

