==Trivia==
*The emote is based on the dances found in South Korean artist PSY's music video {{wp|Gangnam Style}}. In these dances, the performer pretends to ride a [[horse]], alternately holding the reins and spinning a lasso, before moving into a sidestepping horse trot.

