{{external|rs}} {{Infobox Scenery |version1 = Cannon |version2 = Flying |version3 = Hot air balloon |name = Crazy penguin |image1 = [[File:Crazy penguin (cannon).png|250x250px]] |image2 = [[File:Crazy penguin (flying).png|250x250px]] |image3 = [[File:Crazy penguin (balloon).png|250x250px]] |release = [[29 January]] [[2007]] |update = What's black and white and goes green when it's finished? |members = Yes |location = [[Iceberg]] |options = None |examine = It looks like they're trying to fly! |map1 = {{Map|name=Crazy penguin|2634,4047|mtype=pin|group=cannon}} |map2 = {{Map|name=Crazy penguin|2631,4042|mtype=pin|group=flying}} |map3 = {{Map|name=Crazy penguin|2639,4048|mtype=pin|group=balloon}} |id1 = 21092 |id2 = 21093 |id3 = 21094 }} '''Crazy penguins''' can be found at the start of the [[Penguin Agility Course]]. They are attempting to fly via various methods the player reports during the [[Cold War]] quest.
One penguin can be seen trying to jump off a platform and fly, without success. A second may be found trying to use a cannon to fly. A third may also be found using a hot air balloon. The appearance of the balloon and cannon penguins are based on whether the [[Enlightened Journey]] and [[Between a Rock...]] quests, respectively, were completed at the time the report was given to [[Penguin (Cold War)|KGP penguin]] in Ardougne Zoo during the [[Cold War]] quest. If either of the two quests were not completed at the time of the report, the corresponding crazy penguin is replaced with a simple [[wooden platform]].
