{{Infobox Scenery |name = Creature keeper |image = [[File:Creature keeper.png|200px]] |release = [[5 January]] [[2017]] |update = Chambers of Xeric |members = Yes |quest = No |location = [[Chambers of Xeric]] |options = Search |examine = He's dead. |map = No |id = 29875 }} The '''creature keeper''' is a caretaker who is found dead in the [[Chambers of Xeric]], having accompanied [[Xeric]] and his group to [[Mount Quidamortem]]. Originally tasked with raising and tending to animals, the creature keeper [[Corrupted scavenger|domesticated]] a [[scavenger beast]] to make a trained attack beast. While sending it out to fight some [[Lizardman shaman]]s, he was spotted and [[poison]]ed by them, leading to his death. As a result, Xeric's associates were forced to hire a houndmaster to help raise animals for Xeric's experiments.
His body can be searched for his [[Creature keeper's journal|journal]].
{{Chambers of Xeric}}

