{{Infobox Music |name = Crest of a Dwarven Wave |file = [[File:Crest of a Dwarven Wave.ogg]] |release = [[31 May]] [[2005]] |update = Keldagrim - The Dwarven City |removal = [[27 April]] [[2022]] |removal update = Beneath Cursed Sands |members = Yes |location = [[Keldagrim]] |hint = Not unlockable |quest = [[The Giant Dwarf]] |instruments = Tubular Bells, Accordion, Tango Accordion, Pizzicato Strings, Orchestral Harp, Timpani, String Ensemble 2, Alto Sax, Clarinet, Flute, Woodblock, Seashore, Percussion |duration = 01:46 |composer = Ian Taylor |map = No |cacheid = hist406 |tempo=115 BPM|signature=4/4}} '''Crest of a Wave''' was an unlisted music track that previously played during the cutscene when the player first sails to [[Keldagrim]]. [[Crest of a Wave]] was added with the [[Dragon Slayer I]] rework and eventually replaced it.
==Versions== {| class="wikitable embed-audio-links" |- !Version !Release !Music Track |- |1 |[[18 April]] [[2005]] |[[File:Crest of a Dwarven Wave (v1).ogg]] |- |2 |[[31 May]] [[2005]] |[[File:Crest of a Dwarven Wave (v2).ogg]] |- |3 |[[6 March]] [[2007]] |[[File:Crest of a Dwarven Wave.ogg]] |}
