{{Infobox Music |name = Crest of a Wave |number = 689 |file = [[File:Crest of a Wave.ogg]] |release = [[18 June]] [[2007]] |update = The Dragonfire Shield |members = No |location = [[Crandor]] |hint = This track unlocks automatically. |quest = [[Dragon Slayer I]] |instruments = Tubular Bells, Accordion, Tango Accordion, Pizzicato Strings, Orchestral Harp, Timpani, String Ensemble 2, Alto Sax, Clarinet, Flute, Woodblock, Seashore, Percussion |duration = 01:46 |composer = Ian Taylor |map = No |cacheid = 350 |sortname = Crest of a Wave |unlockdetail = Unlocked automatically. |tempo=115|signature=4/4}}
'''Crest of a Wave''' is a music track that is unlocked automatically.
During [[The Giant Dwarf]], it can be heard during the cutscene when the player and the [[Dwarven Boatman]] first sail to [[Keldagrim]]. In [[Dragon Slayer I]], it plays during the cutscene when sailing to [[Crandor]] with [[Captain Ned]].
The start of the jingle plays when travelling via [[Charter ship|Charter ships]], [[Cabin Boy Colin]], and [[Captain Barnaby]], as well as other forms of ship transport.
==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 27 April 2022 |update = Beneath Cursed Sands |change = The music track is now listed in the [[Music Player]]. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
{{Music}}

{{Infobox Scenery |version1 = Passage |version2 = Exit |name = Crevice |image = [[File:Crevice (Brimhaven Dungeon).png|250x250px]] |release = [[27 April]] [[2017]] |update = Diverse Dungeons |members = Yes |location = [[Brimhaven Dungeon]] |options1 = Enter |options2 = Use |examine1 = I can hear the clang of metal scales through here. |examine2 = Smells like fresh air. |map = No |id1 = 30198 |id2 = 30201 }} Three '''crevices''' can be found in the [[Brimhaven Dungeon]] near the [[metal dragons]]. One crevice south of the [[bronze dragon]]s serves as an exit from the dungeon that connects to the [[Hole (Brimhaven Dungeon)|hole]] near [[Tai Bwo Wannai]], accessible after paying for access from [[Banisoch]]. The other two crevices create a passageway from the regular [[iron dragon|iron]] and [[steel dragon]] area to the [[Slayer|Slayer-only]] area.
