{{Infobox Scenery |name = Crevice |image = [[File:Crevice (Deep Wilderness Dungeon).png|300px]] |release = [[5 March]] [[2015]] |update = Achievement Diaries |members = Yes |quest = No |location = [[Deep Wilderness Dungeon]] |options = Use |examine = Leads to another section of the cave. |map = {{Map|name=Crevice|x=3046|y=10332|r=7|width=300|height=300|zoom=2|mapID=26|plane=0|mtype=square}} |id = 19043 }} The '''crevice''' is an [[Agility]] [[shortcut]] found in the [[Deep Wilderness Dungeon]]. An Agility level of 46 and completion of the [[Medium Wilderness Diary]] is required to use the shortcut. The shortcut connects the entrance of the dungeon to the [[Fire Giant]] area.
This shortcut can be used to escape from [[PvP]] combat in cases where the attacker does not meet the requirements to this shortcut.
