{{Infobox Scenery |name = Crevice |image = [[File:Crevice (Ghorrock Dungeon exit).png|270px]] |release = [[11 January]] [[2023]] |update = Secrets of the North & More! |members = Yes |quest = [[Secrets of the North]] |location = [[Ghorrock Dungeon]] |options = Enter |examine = Looks slippery. |map = No |id = 46596 }} A '''crevice''' is found at the north-west corner of the [[Ghorrock Dungeon]] during and after [[Secrets of the North]]. Entering the crevice returns the player back to the [[Salt Mine]] under [[Weiss]].
The crevice is identical to the other [[Crevice (Phantom Muspah)|crevice]] found in the south-west corner of the dungeon that leads to the [[Strange Creature]] fight, or [[Phantom Muspah]] fight after completing the quest.
{{Secrets of the North}}

