A '''crevice''' is a piece of scenery found in the [[Shaman Caves]]. When entered, it takes players back to the first room of the caves after the player has searched the [[Bookcase (Shaman Caves)|bookcase]]. Looking at the crevice results in the message: {{mes|It looks like a crevice, you could possibly squeeze through.}}. Searching the crevice results in the message: "You search the crevice. It looks as if you might be able to squeeze through, would you like to try?"

