{{External|rs}} {{otheruses|the crocodiles encountered on the surface|the Tombs of Amascut variant|Crocodile (Tombs of Amascut)}} {{Infobox Monster |version1 = Water |version2 = Land |version3 = Water & land |name = Crocodile |image = [[File:Crocodile.png|280px]] |release = [[26 April]] [[2005]] |update = Desert Month Finale |members = Yes |combat = 63 |size = 2 |examine = Never smile at a... |xpbonus = 0 |max hit = 6 |aggressive = Yes |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Slash]] |attack speed = 4 |respawn = 40 |slayxp = 62 |cat = Crocodiles |assignedby = vannaka |hitpoints = 62 |att = 53 |str = 54 |def = 54 |mage = 1 |range = 1 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 20 |dslash = 12 |dcrush = 22 |dmagic = 10 |dlight = 20 |dstandard = 20 |dheavy = 20 |elementalweaknesstype = Earth |elementalweaknesspercent = 40 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 0 |immunecannon = No |immunethrall = No |dropversion1 = On water |dropversion2 = |dropversion3 = On water |id1 = 11581 |id2 = 11582 |id3 = 4184 }} '''Crocodiles''' are found in the [[Kharidian Desert]] south of [[Pollnivneach]] on either side of the [[River Elid]]. They are often assigned as [[Slayer]] [[Slayer task|tasks]] by [[Vannaka]]. Their drop table is rather poor, with only common herbs as a very rare drop, so you'll be getting only [[bones]] most of the time. Bring [[waterskin]]s to avoid dying of thirst.
A great place to fight crocodiles is on the south side of the river, directly south of the small island where the crocodiles spawn. Because crocodiles are [[Aggressiveness|aggressive]] from a few squares away, this place attracts crocodiles from in the water where they cannot usually be reached, and is much less click-intensive. There is a [[safespot]] for crocodiles directly west of the [[magic carpet]] at Nardah, on a cactus near the river north-west of the crack in the desert. There are two crocodile spawns that can be safespotted, which makes the task considerably easier.
Alternatively, they can be safespotted on the wall east of the [[Ruins of Unkah]].
Another place to fight crocodiles (if [[Icthlarin's Little Helper]] has been completed) is just north of [[Sophanem]], by the river just outside the gate. There is an altar for prayer, and a sink just south of that inside of the city, allowing for prolonged trips.
The area south of the Ruins of Ullek, south-west of the teak trees has 12 crocodile spawns and does not require water for the player to survive, so long as the player stays in the grassy area near the water. This can be useful for players who do not wish to bring many waterskins with them.
There are three varieties of crocodile: one can only walk on water, one can only walk on land, and one can walk on both land and water. The ones confined to the water are most easily safespotted, simply by standing one tile back from the shore. If a crocodile dies while its south-west tile is over water, it will not drop bones, though it can still drop herbs which must be [[telegrab]]bed if the herb is not on or adjacent to a traversable tile.
