==Trivia== *{{WP|Crop circle}}s refer to the patterns of flattened crop often created as a hoax, but which are sometimes assigned an alien origin by fringe theorists. *A crop circle is called a 'Puromantic portal' by the Fairies.{{CiteNPC|npc=Fairy Aeryka|quote=Crop circle? Oh, you mean the Puromantic portal?}}
