The '''crossbow tree''' is an [[Agility]] [[shortcut]] found between [[Catherby]] and [[Obelisk of Water]]. Useful for crossing from [[Obelisk of Water]] back to [[Catherby]], particularly when [[charging water orbs]]. Note this is a one-way grapple, you cannot go from [[Catherby]] to [[Obelisk of Water]].

Using the shortcut requires having a [[Crossbow (weapon)|crossbow]] and a [[mith grapple]] equipped, and requires levels {{SCP|Agility|36|link=yes}}, {{SCP|Strength|22|link=yes}}, and {{SCP|Ranged|39|link=yes}}. Using this shortcut is a required task for the [[Medium Kandarin Diary]].

