{{External|rs}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Crunchy |image = [[File:Crunchy.png|130px]] |release = [[16 February]] [[2017]] |update = Party Pete's Birthday Bash |members = No |race = [[Skeleton]] |location = [[Old School Museum]] |gender = Male |options = None |examine = A famous skeletal knight. |map = {{Map|name=Crunchy|x=3035|y=9937|plane=0|mapID=10124|mtype=pin}} |id = 8001 |leagueRegion = Asgarnia }} '''Crunchy''' is a [[skeleton]] found in the [[Old School Museum]]. [[Jagex]] often used him for promotional material on the ''RuneScape'' website. Crunchy is depicted as a skeletal warrior with a metallic helmet, and was accompanied by a [[human]] named [[Tim]]. The small dragon seen with the two is Tim's pet, [[Eski]].
His most famous role was holding the "High Detail" button before ''RuneScape'' HD's release. The two also featured on various other pieces of artwork released by Jagex, as well as on the cover of ''[[RuneScape - The Official Handbook]]''. <gallery> File:Tim & Crunchy artwork original.jpg|The original wallpaper depicting Tim and Crunchy. File:Tim & Crunchy artwork remastered.png|The remastered wallpaper depicting Tim and Crunchy as part of Old School RuneScape's 5th birthday celebrations. File:Tim and Crunchy backdrop.png|The wallpaper recreated in-game within the Falador Party Room's basement museum. File:Tim & Crunchy 2006.png|The original ''RuneScape'' website artwork of Tim and Crunchy. File:Tim & Crunchy 2003.png|Tim and Crunchy's predecessors. File:RuneScape- Original Soundtrack Classics.jpg|Crunchy as seen on the cover of ''[[RuneScape: Original Soundtrack Classics]]'' File:Postbag from the Hedge - The woeful tale of the bunny ears. (1).png|[[Tim]], Crunchy, and [[Eski]] at the beach. </gallery>
