{{external|rs}} {{Infobox Monster |name = Cruor |image = [[File:Cruor.png|120px]] |release = [[5 January]] [[2022]] |update = Nex: The Fifth General |members = Yes |combat = 285 |size = 1 |examine = A mage who has mastered the art of blood magic. |xpbonus = 5 |flatarmour = -2 |max hit = 29 |aggressive = Yes (after Nex makes him vulnerable) |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Magic]] |attack speed = 5 |hitpoints = 500 |att = 1 |str = 1 |def = 200 |mage = 200 |range = 1 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 25 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 100 |dslash = 25 |dcrush = 100 |dmagic = 150 |dlight = 50 |dstandard = 50 |dheavy = 50 |poisonresistance = 100 |venomresistance = 100 |immunecannon = Yes |immunethrall = No |id = 11285 |leagueRegion = Asgarnia }} '''Cruor''' is one of the four mages guarding [[Nex]] in the [[God Wars Dungeon#Ancient Prison|Ancient Prison]], within in the [[God Wars Dungeon]]. Having mastered [[blood spells|blood magic]], he enhances Nex's powers over blood. As with all of Nex's mages, he is immobile.
Cruor is invulnerable to damage until Nex reaches below 40% of her hitpoints. This is indicated by her shouting, {{overhead|Cruor, don't fail me!}}
He attacks using [[Blood Barrage]] and can heal himself a percentage of the damage inflicted.
