{{Infobox Prayer |name = Cruor's Vow |image = [[File:Cruor's Vow.png]] |release = [[12 April]] [[2023]] |update = Desert Treasure II Rewards Beta |members = Yes |level = 89 |drain = 24 |effect = While activated, defeating a foe will drain 3 prayer points and heal 3 hitpoints. |sound = [[File:Smite.ogg]] }} '''Cruor's Vow''' is a prayer from the [[Ruinous Powers]] prayer book, unlocked at level 89 [[Prayer]]. It can be used by selecting the [[Ruinous Powers (relic)|Ruinous Powers relic]] in [[Trailblazer Reloaded League]] or by purchasing the [[Ruinous powers (Deadman Mode)|Ruinous powers]] book in [[Deadman: Annihilation]].
Upon killing an opponent, Cruor's Vow will heal 3 Hitpoints and drain 3 Prayer points.
Only one Ancient Vow can be activated at a time.
The prayer was originally available to use on a [[beta world]] as part of the [[Unrestricted_world#DT2_Rewards_Beta|DT2 Rewards Beta]] after having passed the [[Poll:The Ruinous Powers: Community Consultation|relevant consultation poll]], where players could playtest it in various content before a second poll was brought forward to ask players whether they'd like the prayers to be implemented in the live game as a reward from completing the quest [[Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire]].
==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 14 June 2023 |update = Ruinous Powers Beta v2 |change = * The Prayer level required to activate the prayer has been increased from 86 to 89. * The prayer's drain rate has been increased from 20 points per minute to 24. * The prayer's description in-game has been changed. Previously, it was "''Attacks have a 10% chance to heal you for 10% of the damage you dealt.''" }} {{Subject changes |date = 18 April 2023 |update = Makeover Improvements |change = The prayer's description in-game has been changed. Previously, it was "''Attacks have a 10% chance to heal 10% of the damage you dealt.''" }} {{Subject changes footer}}
{{Ruinous Powers}}

{{Infobox Combat Achievement |name = Crush Hour |image = [[File:The Nightmare.png|150px]] |release = [[12 August]] [[2021]] |update = Tombs of Amascut: Rewards Beta |members = Yes |description = Kill Phosani's Nightmare while killing every parasite and husk in one hit. |tier = Master |monster = Phosani's Nightmare |type = Mechanical |id = 406 |leagueRegion = Morytania }} '''Crush Hour''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to defeat [[Phosani's Nightmare]] while killing every [[Husk (Phosani's Nightmare)|husk]] and [[Parasite (Phosani's Nightmare)|parasite]] that appears in a single hit.
==Strategy== Both the husk and parasite will take damage equal to the player's maximum hit if a weapon with a crush attack style is used to attack them. [[Husk (Phosani's Nightmare)|Husks]] have 20 health and can be instantly killed by most forms of crush-based weaponry, while [[Parasite (Phosani's Nightmare)|Parasites]] have 55 health, which can be dealt with using a strong two-handed weapon like a [[godsword]], [[elder maul]], [[soulreaper axe]] or the special attack of the [[dragon mace]]. The unweakened variant gains extra health, which is too high for these weapons.
Note that if a [[thrall]] attacks either at the same time the player does, the achievement will fail.
==Other tasks== {{Combat Achievements list|Phosani's Nightmare}}
==Trivia== *The name and nature of the achievement is a reference to a [[wikipedia:Rush hour|rush hour]].
{{Combat Achievements}}

