{{External|rs}}
'''Crystal''' is a material used by the [[elves]], which was gifted to them by their goddess [[Seren]]. It is infused with some of her divine power, and is an important part of elven culture. It can be shaped, formed, and magically charged into weapons, tools, or other items with magical powers by the use of [[Crystal seed (disambiguation)|crystal seeds]] and [[crystal shard]]s. Crystal seeds and shards can be transformed via [[crystal singing]], either by using a [[singing bowl]] with sufficient [[Crafting]] and [[Smithing]] levels, or by the service of a [[crystal singer]]. Crystal shards can also be ground into [[crystal dust]] for use in [[Herblore]], to transform certain combat stat-boosting potions into [[divine potion]]s.

==Crystal components==
Most crystal items are created from both seeds and shards, but some only require one of either.
