{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Yellow |version2 = Magenta |version3 = Cyan |version4 = Grey |name = Crystal |image1 = [[File:Crystal (yellow).png]] |image2 = [[File:Crystal (magenta).png]] |image3 = [[File:Crystal (cyan).png]] |image4 = [[File:Crystal (grey).png]] |release = [[7 May]] [[2003]] |update = New - Watch Tower Quest! |members = Yes |quest = [[Watchtower]] |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Destroy |destroy = This item will likely break if you put it down here and you will have to go looking for another. |examine1 = A yellow crystal that's meant to power the Watchtower in Yanille. |examine2 = A magenta crystal that's meant to power the Watchtower in Yanille. |examine3 = A cyan crystal that's meant to power the Watchtower in Yanille. |examine4 = A grey crystal that's meant to power the Watchtower in Yanille. |value = 1 |weight = 0.907 |id1 = 2380 |id2 = 2381 |id3 = 2382 |id4 = 2383 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Crystal (yellow) detail.png|left|100px]] |version2 = [[File:Crystal (magenta) detail.png|left|100px]] |version3 = [[File:Crystal (cyan) detail.png|left|100px]] |version4 = [[File:Crystal (grey) detail.png|left|100px]] }} '''Crystal''' is a quest item that appears in the [[Watchtower]] quest. As the quest opens, ogres have stolen the four crystals needed to power the [[Watchtower (building)|watchtower]] and protect [[Yanille]] from invasion by the ogres. There are four crystals, each a different colour, and the player must retrieve them by performing various tasks around [[Gu'Tanoth]].
* Yellow Crystal - obtained from [[Grew]] in return for Gorad's [[Ogre tooth|tooth]]. * Magenta Crystal - obtained by completing the dialogue with the [[Mad skavid]] after learning bits of the Skavid language. * Cyan Crystal - obtained from the last [[Ogre shaman|Ogre Shaman]] killed in the [[Ogre Enclave]]. (If lost, it is reobtained by picking-up and searching the [[shaman robe]] found within the enclave.) * Grey Crystal - found by mining the [[Rock of Dalgroth]], within the centre of the Ogre Enclave. (Requires all Ogre Shaman to be dead.)
