The '''Crystal Sea''' is part of the [[Western Ocean]], west of [[Tirannwn]]. To the east lie [[Porth Neigwl]] and [[Tirannwn Bight]]. [[Pilgrims' Passage]] lies to the north, [[Port Roberts]] is to the west, and [[Western Gate]] and the island of [[Minotaurs' Rest]] lie to the south.

Boats that do not have an [[adamant keel]] or better will suffer significant damage when trying to sail on the [[crystal-flecked waters]].

==Sea charting==
Charting activates reward various amounts of [[Sailing]] experience, with significant bonus experience for completing every charting task in any given sea or ocean. 

