{{Infobox Scenery |name = Crystal Singing Recipes |image = [[File:Crystal Singing Recipes (The Corrupted Gauntlet).png|211px]] |release = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |update = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |quest = [[Song of the Elves]] |location = [[The Gauntlet]] |options = Read |examine = A book of recipes for crystal singing. |map = {{Map|1972,5666|plane=1|r=4|mapID=-1|mtype=square}} |id = 35978 }}
'''Crystal Singing Recipes''' is a bookstand in the starting room of [[The Gauntlet|The Corrupted Gauntlet]]. Players can click the bookstand to get an overview of all recipes for armour and weaponry found within The Corrupted Gauntlet.
{{The Gauntlet}}

{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Music |name = Crystal Sword |number = 30 |file = [[File:Crystal Sword.ogg]] |release = [[15 March]] [[2004]] |update = RS2 Music player and fixes |members = No |location = [[Wilderness]], [[Ardougne sewers]] |hint = This track unlocks in the Wilderness. |quest = No |instruments = Electric Piano 1, Celesta, Vibraphone, Contrabass, Pizzicato Strings, Orchestral Harp, Choir Aahs, Synth Brass 1, Ocarina, Pad 8 (sweep) |duration = 02:49 |signature = 4/4 |album = ''[[RuneScape: Original Soundtrack Classics]]'' |composer = Ian Taylor |map = {{Map:Wilderness music|height=150|zoom=-2}}{{Map:Wilderness 2 music|height=150|zoom=1}}{{Map|2624,9664|2624,9728|2688,9728|2688,9664|plane=0|height=150|group=1|mapID=-1|mtype=polygon|bucket=both}} |cacheid = 169 |sortname = Crystal Sword |unlockdetail = Unlocked in the [[Wilderness]] or in [[Ardougne]]'s [[Ardougne Sewers#Eastern Ardougne Sewers|eastern sewers]]. }} '''Crystal Sword''' is a [[music]] track that is unlocked in the [[Wilderness]] or in [[Ardougne]]'s [[Ardougne Sewers#Eastern Ardougne Sewers|eastern sewers]]. It also plays at [[Wilderness Agility Course Dungeon]].
In Classic mode, the track plays in level 1 [[Wilderness]], north of [[Varrock]] as well as Ardougne's eastern sewers.
{| class="floatleft" |{{Map|3200,3520|3200,3584|3264,3584|3264,3520|plane=0|group=2|mapID=-1|mtype=polygon|bucket=hist|caption=Location before 2021 and on Classic mode}} |}
