{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Construction |name = Crystal ball |image = [[file:crystal ball built.png|70px]] |icon = [[File:Crystal ball icon.png]] |furniturename = Crystal ball |release = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |update = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |level = 42 |experience = 280 |room = [[Study]] |hotspot = [[Crystal ball space]] |flatpack = No |examine = Use an elemental staff on it. |id = 13659 |itemid = 8351 }} The '''crystal ball''' can be built in the [[crystal ball space]] of the [[study]] in a [[player-owned house]]. It requires 42 [[Construction]] to build and gives 280 [[experience]] when built. The player must have a [[hammer]] and a [[saw]] in their inventory to build it.
An [[Elemental staves|elemental staff]] can be used on the crystal ball to change the staff's elemental alignment for free.
