==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 5 March 2025 |update = Game Jam: Charges QoL |change = The Crystal body supports a bank item option for changing charges. }} {{Subject changes |date = 24 May 2023 |update = Bounty Hunter is Back! |change = Players can no longer cast [[alchemy]] spells on the Crystal body. }} {{Subject changes |date = 8 February 2023 |update = Poll 78 Updates & More |poll = New Skill: Community Consultation and Poll 78 |change = Crystals from [[Lliann's Wares]] can now be used to recolour the body. }} {{Subject changes |date = 30 June 2021 |update = Phosani's Nightmare |poll = Equipment Rebalance: Ranged Meta |change = The crystal body has received the following changes: * Weight decreased from 9.979 kg to 2.000 kg. * Ranged Attack bonus increased from +30 to +31. * Stab Defence bonus increased from +34 to +46. * Slash Defence bonus increased from +24 to +38. * Crush Defence bonus increased from +32 to +48. * Ranged Defence bonus increased from +53 to +68. * The set bonuses when wearing crystal armour with the crystal bow has been removed, instead redistributed among each piece of the set. As a result... ** The accuracy bonus has been increased from 6% to 15%. ** The damage bonus has been increased from 3% to 7.5%. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
