{{Beta}} {{Infobox Item |name = Crystal body (beta) |image = [[File:Crystal body (beta).png]] |release = [[27 January]] [[2021]] |update = Shades of Mort'ton Rework |removal = [[3 February]] [[2021]] |removalupdate = The Isle of Souls |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Sturdier than it looks. |value = 1000 |weight = 9.979 |id = 25496 }} [[File:Crystal body (beta) detail.png|left|130px]] The '''crystal body (beta)''' is a variant of the [[crystal body]] that is available in an [[unrestricted world]] during the [[Unrestricted world#Equipment Rebalancing Beta|Equipment Rebalancing Beta]], as a means to test its damage bonus increase in the [[Update:Equipment_Rebalancing_Changes#|Equipment Rebalancing Changes]] blog. Players can obtain one within the [[Supplies (unrestricted world)|supplies]] table in the [[Clan Wars]] building in [[Ferox Enclave]].
When the full set is worn, a 20% damage bonus (compared to the current 15% in the live game) and 30% accuracy bonus is applied when using the [[crystal bow]].
