{{Otheruses|the historical version of the Crystal bow|the current version of this item|Crystal bow}} {{Gone|update=Song of the Elves}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = New |version2 = Full |version3 = 9/10 |version4 = 8/10 |version5 = 7/10 |version6 = 6/10 |version7 = 5/10 |version8 = 4/10 |version9 = 3/10 |version10 = 2/10 |version11 = 1/10 |name1 = New crystal bow |name2 = Crystal bow full |name3 = Crystal bow 9/10 |name4 = Crystal bow 8/10 |name5 = Crystal bow 7/10 |name6 = Crystal bow 6/10 |name7 = Crystal bow 5/10 |name8 = Crystal bow 4/10 |name9 = Crystal bow 3/10 |name10 = Crystal bow 2/10 |name11 = Crystal bow 1/10 |image = [[File:Crystal bow.png]] |release = [[7 February]] [[2005]] |update = Roving Elves |removal = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |removalupdate = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |quest = [[Roving Elves]] |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |tradeable3 = No |tradeable4 = No |tradeable5 = No |tradeable6 = No |tradeable7 = No |tradeable8 = No |tradeable9 = No |tradeable10 = No |tradeable11 = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = |options = Wield, Drop |examine = A nice sturdy magical bow. |value1 = 279000 |value2 = 279000 |value3 = 275000 |value4 = 250000 |value5 = 225000 |value6 = 200000 |value7 = 175000 |value8 = 150000 |value9 = 125000 |value10 = 100000 |value11 = 50000 |alchable = No |weight = 1.814 |exchange1 = Yes |exchange2 = No |exchange3 = No |exchange4 = No |exchange5 = No |exchange6 = No |exchange7 = No |exchange8 = No |exchange9 = No |exchange10 = No |exchange11 = No |gemwname1 = New crystal bow |gemwname2 = |gemwname3 = |gemwname4 = |gemwname5 = |gemwname6 = |gemwname7 = |gemwname8 = |gemwname9 = |gemwname10 = |gemwname11 = |id1 = 4212 |id2 = 4214 |id3 = 4215 |id4 = 4216 |id5 = 4217 |id6 = 4218 |id7 = 4219 |id8 = 4220 |id9 = 4221 |id10 = 4222 |id11 = 4223 }} [[File:Crystal bow detail.png|left|130px]] The '''crystal bow''' was a [[Degradation|degradable]] [[bow]] made from enchanted [[elves|elven]] [[crystal]]. It required the completion of [[Roving Elves]] to wield, as well as 50 [[Agility]] and 70 [[Ranged]]. Along with the [[crystal shield]], [[crystal halberd]] and the [[crystal saw]], it was one of the four pieces of [[crystal equipment]] in ''[[Old School RuneScape]]''.
These crystal bows functioned differently to the present day [[Crystal bow]]. They would degrade over time with use, and their stats would gradually decrease as the bow degraded. Furthermore, the bow could be traded when it was entirely new, and turned into banknotes.
With the release of [[Song of the Elves]], all existing Crystal bows reverted into [[Crystal weapon seed]]s. As a result, these items are currently unobtainable; however, they remain in the game files.
==Combat stats== {{Infobox Bonuses |version1 = New |version2 = Full |version3 = 9/10 |version4 = 8/10 |version5 = 7/10 |version6 = 6/10 |version7 = 5/10 |version8 = 4/10 |version9 = 3/10 |version10 = 2/10 |version11 = 1/10 |astab = 0 |aslash = 0 |acrush = 0 |amagic = 0 |arange1 = +100 |arange2 = +100 |arange3 = +96 |arange4 = +92 |arange5 = +88 |arange6 = +84 |arange7 = +80 |arange8 = +76 |arange9 = +72 |arange10 = +68 |arange11 = +64 |dstab = 0 |dslash = 0 |dcrush = 0 |dmagic = 0 |drange = 0 |str = 0 |rstr1 = +70 |rstr2 = +70 |rstr3 = +68 |rstr4 = +66 |rstr5 = +64 |rstr6 = +62 |rstr7 = +60 |rstr8 = +58 |rstr9 = +56 |rstr10 = +54 |rstr11 = +52 |mdmg = 0 |prayer = 0 |slot = 2h |speed = 5 |attackrange = 10 |combatstyle = Bow |image = [[File:Crystal bow equipped male.png|130px]] |altimage = [[File:Crystal bow equipped female.png|130px]] }}
{{CombatStyles|Bow|speed=5|attackrange=10}}
==Degrading== The crystal bow degraded over time. After 250 hits, it degraded into a "'''Crystal bow 9/10'''", and thereafter for every 250 hits, it degraded another 1/10th until it reverted into a [[crystal seed]] after a total of 2,500 hits, and must be recharged before it could be used again. As the bow degraded, its [[Equipment Stats#Attack bonuses|accuracy]] and [[Equipment Stats#Other bonuses|strength]] bonuses decreased as shown below.
{| class="wikitable" ! rowspan="2" |Condition ! colspan="4" |Attack Bonus |- !{{plinkp|Ranged attack bonus|pic=Ranged icon}} !{{plinkp|Ranged strength|pic=Ranged Strength icon}} |- |New/Full | +100 | +70 |- |9/10 | +96 | +68 |- |8/10 | +92 | +66 |- |7/10 | +88 | +64 |- |6/10 | +84 | +62 |- |5/10 | +80 | +60 |- |4/10 | +76 | +58 |- |3/10 | +72 | +56 |- |2/10 | +68 | +54 |- |1/10 | +64 | +52 |}
The crystal bow could be imbued for 2,000 [[Nightmare Zone]] points per charge, requiring 20,000 points to imbue a fully charged bow. Imbuing the crystal bow did not keep it from degrading, however its stats would remain at their maximum, regardless of how much it had degraded. When the bow reverted back to a crystal seed, it would lose its imbue, and players had to imbue it again using points from the Nightmare Zone. Additionally, imbuing a crystal bow that had already degraded to 9/10 or below would restore the bow's stats to their maximum.
==Obtaining & trading crystal bows== A crystal bow with 2/10 charges was a possible reward for completion of [[Roving Elves]]. Additionally, players could buy new crystal bows from [[Islwyn]] for 900,000 coins each.
The distinction between a ''new'' crystal bow and a ''full'' crystal bow was important, as only new crystal bows were tradeable. A crystal bow that was bought from Islwyn was new; a crystal seed that was re-enchanted into a crystal bow by Ilfeen is full. Once a shot is fired from a new crystal bow, it became a full crystal bow, and was untradeable.
As crystal seeds were tradeable, players could buy them from other players and pay Ilfeen to re-enchant them into crystal bows.
