The '''Crystal chest''' can be found in the house directly south of the [[witch's house (location)|witch's house]] in [[Taverley]]. The chest is locked and can only be opened using a [[crystal key]], which is made by combining a [[loop half of key]] and a [[tooth half of key]]. Attempting to open the chest without the crystal key yields the message: ''This chest is securely locked shut.'' Opening the crystal chest grants an [[uncut dragonstone]] and possibly a variety of other rewards.

Opening the crystal chest is a task for the medium [[Falador Diary]].

