{{Infobox Item |name = Crystal crown |image = [[File:Crystal crown (Ithell).png]] |release = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |update = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Drop |examine = A crown fit for the most wealthy of elves. |value = 250000000 |alchable = No |weight = 0.300 |id = 23911 }} [[File:Crystal crown (Ithell) detail.png|left|150px]] [[File:Crystal crown (Ithell) chathead.png|left]] The '''crystal crown''' is a purely cosmetic crown purchasable from the [[Lliann's Wares]] in [[Prifddinas]]'s Ithell district for 250,000,000 coins. The crown is untradeable, and it cannot be alchemised or sold back to [[Lliann]]'s shop.
It should be noted that Lliann's Wares initially carries three crowns in stock. Each crown in stock is set to resupply after as many game ticks as it costs (250 million), which can take several years. However, like all other shops, the stock refreshes back to three crowns after server restarts, such as maintenance or [[game updates]]. Due to the low number of players wishing to buy crystal crowns, the restock time should not be a concern.
The crown’s colours, based on that of the Ithell Clan, may be changed to other colours of the Elven Clans. The crystals needed to do so can be bought from the same store for 500,000 coins each. It can also be reverted to the Ithell Clan's colour by using the [[crystal of Ithell]] on any variant of the crystal crown.
Upon an unsafe death, the crown is sent to the player’s gravestone. Above level 20 [[Wilderness]], it is permanently lost and converted into 30 million gold coins; in a PvP death, these coins are granted to the killer.
