==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 3 December 2025 |update = Sailing XP Review & Further Fixes |change = * The crystal extractor now gives 250 XP per harvest, down from 600 XP. * The crystal extractor now charges while at a dock or port and continues charging for around 10 seconds after disembarking. }} {{Subject changes |date = 26 November 2025 |update = Sailing: Week One Feedback & Fixes |change = * The crystal extractor no longer works while near a dock or bank boat. * The crystal extractor will now reset its charge progress when the player restarts a [[Barracuda Trial]], and will not charge while the trial is 'paused'. ** When you interact with it, the trial timer will start. If it was activated before the trial started, it will re-activate automatically when you start moving. }} {{Subject changes |date = 5 November 2025 |update = Sailing Technical Pre-Release |change = The scenery was added to the game but unobtainable. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
