'''Crystal glider's outfit''' is obtained from the [[Chest (Laguna Aurorae)|chest]] found in [[Laguna Aurorae]] by using the [[Serrated key]]. Obtaining the outfit requires level 61 [[Agility]] to cross a stepping stone to reach the chest aswell as 72 [[Sailing]] to obtain the Serrated key. The outfit can be stored in a [[magic wardrobe]] in the [[costume room]] of a [[player-owned house]]. 

*{{plink|Crystal glider's hat}}
*{{plink|Crystal glider's jacket}}
*{{plink|Crystal glider's trousers}}
*{{plink|Crystal glider's shoes}}

If lost, more can be obtained from the same [[Chest (Laguna Aurorae)|chest]] without a key required.

