{{Gone|update=Song of the Elves}} {{Otheruses|the Crystal halberd as it functioned before 2019|the present version of the item|Crystal halberd}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = New |version2 = Full |version3 = 9/10 |version4 = 8/10 |version5 = 7/10 |version6 = 6/10 |version7 = 5/10 |version8 = 4/10 |version9 = 3/10 |version10 = 2/10 |version11 = 1/10 |name1 = New crystal halberd full |name2 = Crystal halberd full |name3 = Crystal halberd 9/10 |name4 = Crystal halberd 8/10 |name5 = Crystal halberd 7/10 |name6 = Crystal halberd 6/10 |name7 = Crystal halberd 5/10 |name8 = Crystal halberd 4/10 |name9 = Crystal halberd 3/10 |name10 = Crystal halberd 2/10 |name11 = Crystal halberd 1/10 |image = [[File:Crystal halberd.png]] |release = [[5 March]] [[2015]] |update = Achievement Diaries |removal = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |removalupdate = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = |options = Wield, Drop |examine = A nice sturdy pike. |value = 279000 |weight = 1.814 |id1 = 13091 |id2 = 13092 |id3 = 13093 |id4 = 13094 |id5 = 13095 |id6 = 13096 |id7 = 13097 |id8 = 13098 |id9 = 13099 |id10 = 13100 |id11 = 13101 }} [[File:Crystal halberd detail.png|left|150x150px]] The '''crystal halberd''' was a [[Degradation|degradable]] two-handed [[weapon]] made from [[Elves|elven]] [[crystal]]. It required completion of the [[Hard Western Provinces Diary]] to wield, as well as 70 [[Attack]], 35 [[Strength]] and 50 [[Agility]].
These crystal halberds functioned differently to the present day [[Crystal halberd]]. They would degrade over time with use, and their stats would gradually decrease as the halberd degraded.
With the release of [[Song of the Elves]], all existing Crystal halberds reverted into [[Crystal weapon seed]]s. As a result, these items are currently unobtainable; however, they remain in the game files.
