==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 5 March 2025 |update = Game Jam: Charges QoL |change = The Crystal helm supports a bank item option for changing charges. }} {{Subject changes |date = 24 May 2023 |update = Bounty Hunter is Back! |change = Players can no longer cast [[alchemy]] spells on the Crystal helm. }} {{Subject changes |date = 8 February 2023 |update = Poll 78 Updates & More |poll = New Skill: Community Consultation and Poll 78 |change = Crystals from [[Lliann's Wares]] can now be used to recolour the helm. }} {{Subject changes |date = 30 June 2021 |update = Phosani's Nightmare |poll = Equipment Rebalance: Ranged Meta |change = The crystal helm has received the following changes: * Weight decreased from 2.721 kg to 0.500 kg. * Ranged Attack bonus increased from +8 to +9. * Magic Defence bonus decreased from +26 to +10. * The set bonuses when wearing crystal armour with the crystal bow has been removed, instead redistributed among each piece of the set. As a result... ** The accuracy bonus has been decreased from 6% to 5%. ** The damage bonus has been decreased from 3% to 2.5%. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
==Trivia== *The examine information may be a reference to the Rihanna song [[wikipedia:Diamonds_(Rihanna_song)|''Diamonds'']].
