c defence: +10 for baby-eclectic +20 for nature +30 for magpie +40 for ninja +50 for dragon & lucky }} |att = 0 |str = 0 |def = 0 |mage = 1 |range = 1 |attbns = -10 |strbns = -10 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = -10 |dslash = -10 |dcrush = -10 |dmagic = 50 |dlight = -10 |dstandard = -10 |dheavy = -10 |poisonresistance = 100 |venomresistance = 100 |dpscalc = no |id1 = 8741 |id2 = 8742 |id3 = 8743 |id4 = 8744 |id5 = 8745 |id6 = 8746 |id7 = 8747 |id8 = 8748 |id9 = 8749 |id10 = 8750 |id11 = 8751 |id12 = 8752 |id13 = 8753 |id14 = 8754 |id15 = 8755 |id16 = 8756 |id17 = 8757 |leagueRegion = Tirannwn }} The '''crystal impling''' is the third highest-level [[impling]] that can be caught in [[Gielinor]]. Players require at least 80 [[Hunter]] (or level 74 with a [[super hunter potion]]) to capture this type of impling with a [[butterfly net]], and optionally an [[impling jar]]. At level 90 Hunter, crystal implings can be caught barehanded. Capturing a crystal impling grants 280 Hunter [[experience]].
Currently, crystal implings can only be caught from rare spawns within [[Prifddinas]]. One may be found at a time on each [[world]], respawning at :00 and :30, and becoming visible 3 minutes afterward.
== Hunter info == {{Hunter info |name = Crystal impling |level = 80 |xp = 280 |trap = {{plink|Butterfly net}} or {{plink|Magic butterfly net}} |container = {{plink|Impling jar}} |retaliation = No }}
The chance of successfully catching a crystal impling is between ~45% at level 80 and ~55% at level 99.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1573634900921573377|date=24 September 2022|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/96595|archivedate=30 September 2022}}
When catching barehanded or with a [[magic butterfly net]], the catch chance is increased by 7.8%.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1413192817275457546|date=8 July 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104105|archivedate=21 May 2022|quote=For barehanded or a magic net, add 8 percentage points to the chances - which means you do get a no-fail chance.}}
{{Skilling success chart|label=Crystal impling catch chance|showbefore=no |label1=Butterfly net|low1=8|high1=141|req1=80|color1=saddlebrown|image1=Butterfly net.png |label2=Barehanded or magic butterfly net|low2=28|high2=161|req2=80|color2=green|image2=Magic butterfly net.png }}
== Strategy == There are two main methods in finding crystal implings: '''looping''', and '''world hopping'''.
{{Map|group=prif|mapID=29|mtype=pin|width=400|height=400|align=right|caption=Crystal impling spawns in Prifddinas.|x=3263|y=6070|3290,6117|3307,6041|3210,6110|3213,6049|3237,6102|3308,6117|3240,6046|3214,6113|3290,6049|3234,6072|3240,6120|3234,6129}}
=== Looping === The player will run in a large circle around [[Prifddinas]]. Start by the altar in the [[Hefin Clan|Hefin District]] and run East, turning South at the [[Crystal tree patch|crystal tree patch]], West at the [[Prifddinas General Store|General Store]], then North at the [[Iorwerth Dungeon]] entrance. Complete the lap at the altar, use [[Vile Vigour|Vile Vigour]] or [[Stamina potion|Stamina potions]], and then hop to the next world. If you used Vile Vigour, remember to pray at the altar. If you find a crystal impling before completing the lap, hop immediately to the next world and hop only once you have touched that spot on the next lap.
=== World Hopping === The player will pick a crystal impling hotspot and repeatedly hop worlds, stopping only to catch any crystal implings on screen. Hotspots include: [[Portal (Player-owned house)|Prifddinas player-owned house]], [[Prifddinas north bank]], and [[Prifddinas south bank]]. Because crystal implings only become visible after respawning at :03 and :33, it is best to begin hopping immediately following this time frame.
==Loot== {{#vardefine:LootWithShards|{{#expr: ({{GEP|Divine super combat potion(4)}}*2.5 - {{GEP|Super combat potion(4)}}*2.5 - {{GEP|Ultracompost|1/30}}) * (30*1)/18 + ({{GEP|Divine super combat potion(4)}}*2.5 - {{GEP|Super combat potion(4)}}*2.5) * (35*1)/18 + {{ImpValue|crystal|jar=yes}} }}}} At current [[Grand Exchange]] prices, opening a crystal impling jar gives {{Coins|{{ImpValue|crystal|jar=yes}} round 0}} worth of loot on average, not including any received [[crystal shards]]. If using all crystal shards to make [[divine super combat potion]]s, including those from growing [[crystal acorn]]s into crystal trees with ultracompost, the value becomes {{Coins|floor({{#var:LootWithShards}})}}.
