==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 5 March 2025 |update = Game Jam: Charges QoL |change = The Crystal legs support a bank item option for changing charges. }} {{Subject changes |date = 24 May 2023 |update = Bounty Hunter is Back! |change = Players can no longer cast [[alchemy]] spells on the Crystal legs. }} {{Subject changes |date = 8 February 2023 |update = Poll 78 Updates & More |poll = New Skill: Community Consultation and Poll 78 |change = Crystals from [[Lliann's Wares]] can now be used to recolour the legs. }} {{Subject changes |date = 13 April 2022 |update = Easter 2022 |change = Crystal legs will no longer stretch on players when wielding the [[dragon hunter crossbow]]. }} {{Subject changes |date = 30 June 2021 |update = Phosani's Nightmare |poll = Equipment Rebalance: Ranged Meta |change = The crystal legs has received the following changes: * Weight decreased from 9.071kg to 1.000 kg. * Ranged Attack bonus increased from +17 to +18. * Stab Defence bonus increased from +20 to +26. * Slash Defence bonus increased from +16 to +21. * Crush Defence bonus increased from +24 to +30. * Ranged Defence bonus increased from +29 to +38. * The set bonuses when wearing crystal armour with the crystal bow has been removed, instead redistributed among each piece of the set. As a result... ** The accuracy bonus has been increased from 6% to 10%. ** The damage bonus has been increased from 3% to 5%. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
