{{Infobox Scenery |name = Crystal mote |image = [[File:Crystal mote.png|150px]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |members = Yes |quest = No |location = [[Crystal-flecked waters]] |options = None |examine = The fractured core of a long since sunken crystalline ship. |map = No |id = 58980 |leagueRegion = No }} '''Crystal motes''' are objects found throughout the [[crystal-flecked waters]] in [[Porth Gwenith]], [[Porth Neigwl]], and the [[Tirannwn Bight]].
When the player's [[boat]] passes near or through a crystal mote, a wind mote will be stored within a [[Wind catcher|wind]] or [[gale catcher]]. If the player has the maximum amount of wind motes stored, they will not do anything.
Crystal motes are primarily used for [[the Gwenith Glide]] [[Barracuda Trial]], where players must constantly be boosted by the wind to achieve the required completion times.
