{{gone}} {{Infobox Item |name = Crystal of echoes |image = [[File:Crystal of echoes.png]] |release = [[28 October]] [[2020]] |update = Leagues II - Trailblazer Launch |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Teleport-back, Check-memories, Save-memory |wornoptions = |destroy = You can get this item back by talking to the Sage near Lumbridge. |examine = A strong enough memory can take you back to a familiar place. |value = 10 |weight = 0.000 |id = 25104 }} [[File:Crystal of echoes detail.png|left|140px]] The '''crystal of echoes''' is an item that is obtainable during the [[Grid Master]] [[community event]] via the [[Total Recall]] relic, rewarded after equipping a unique item from the [[God Wars Dungeon]].
The crystal allows players to teleport to store a single coordinate in the [[Gielinor|world]] along with their current [[hitpoints]], [[prayer]], and [[special attack energy]]. Any time later, the player may use the crystal to teleport back to the stored coordinates while setting their hitpoints, prayer, and special attack energy back to their initially stored values.
[[Combat]] stats outside of the ones explicitly listed above '''do not''' get saved by the crystal. There is '''no''' cooldown associated with using the crystal and the save state '''is''' remembered after death. The crystal '''cannot''' store unique special attack energy stats such as those related to the [[soul reaper axe]] or [[sunlight spear]]. This item ignores [[wilderness]] teleport restrictions.
If lost or destroyed, the crystal of echoes can be reclaimed from [[The Sage]].
[[File:Crystal of echoes teleport.webm|thumb|left|Crystal of echoes teleport animation|width=240x240]]
{{Bug|The crystal currently cannot store a value above 127 for Hitpoints, even if the player is overhealed beyond it. This is due to the value stored by the crystal being represented by 7 bits.}}
==Past appearances== This item has appeared in previous [[temporary event]]s: *[[Raging Echoes League]] **It was given to players who unlocked the [[Total Recall (Raging Echoes League)|Total Recall]] relic. **It was also able to store the player's current hitpoints, prayer, and special attack energy. *[[Trailblazer Reloaded League]] **The item was named "Crystal of memories". **It was given to players upon unlocking their tier 3 relic, regardless of selection. **Its ability to teleport to the player's previous location had a cooldown based on the player's total level: ::{|class=wikitable style="text-align:center;" !Cooldown !! Total level |- |6 minutes || 32 |- |5 minutes || 300 |- |4 minutes || 600 |- |3 minutes || 900 |- |2 minutes || 1,200 |- |1 minute || 1,500 |- |None || 1,800 |}
*[[Shattered Relics League]] **The item was named "Crystal of memories". **It was given to players who unlocked the [[Last Recall (Shattered Relics)|Last Recall]] relic. *[[Trailblazer League (2020)]] **The item was named "Crystal of memories". **It was given to players who unlocked the [[Last Recall (Trailblazer)|Last Recall]] relic.
