{{Infobox Item |name = Crystal sapling |image = [[File:Crystal sapling.png]] |release = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |update = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = This sapling is ready to be replanted in a Crystal tree patch. |value = 1 |weight = 0.907 |id = 23659 }} [[File:Crystal sapling detail.png|left|120px]] '''Crystal saplings''' are used to grow [[crystal trees]], with 74 [[Farming]].
They can be made by planting a [[crystal acorn]] in a [[filled plant pot]], with a [[gardening trowel]] in your inventory, and then watering the [[crystal seedling]] with a [[watering can]] or by using [[Humidify]]. When watered, the seedling will sprout into a sapling in one crop cycle (0-5 minutes).
Planting the sapling in the [[crystal tree patch]] in the [[Prifddinas#Crwys district|Crwys district]] in north-east [[Prifddinas]], with a spade in your inventory, will give 180 Farming experience. It will grow into a [[crystal tree]] after 480 minutes (8 hours), which gives 13,240 Farming experience.
The crystal tree cannot become [[Disease (Farming)|diseased]].
Players should use [[ultracompost]] to increase the [[crystal shard]] yield from 16-20 to 28-32 when the tree is cut down.
Crystal saplings '''cannot''' be converted into banknotes by [[Tool Leprechaun|Tool Leprechauns]]. ==Farming info== {{Farming page|Crystal tree}}
