===Growing crystal trees===
[[Crystal weapon seed|Crystal weapon seeds]] can additionally be traded to [[Pennant]] in [[Prifddinas]] for one [[crystal acorn]] each, which can be grown into [[Crystal tree|crystal trees]]. Each tree takes 8 hours to grow and yields an average of 30 crystal shards if the patch was treated with [[ultracompost]]. A shard obtained this way would cost an average of {{Coins|({{GEP|Crystal weapon seed}}+{{GEP|Ultracompost}})/30}}.

===Using a Crystal extractor===
[[Crystal extractor]]s have a  (~1/6) chance to give a shard when activated if the player has completed Song of The Elves. One crystal shard is given on most ocean tiles, while 2 crystal shards are given on crystal-flecked hazardous waters.

