'''Crystal singing''' is the process by which items are made from [[Crystal#Crystal components|Crystal seed]]s and [[Crystal shard]]s. With appropriate [[Smithing]] and [[Crafting]] levels, the player can sing crystal at a [[singing bowl]]; alternatively, a [[Crystal singing#Crystal singers|crystal singer]] can be paid a fee to sing for them.

