{{Infobox Combat Achievement |name = Crystalline Warrior |image = [[File:The Gauntlet.png|300px]] |release = [[21 July]] [[2021]] |update = Combat Achievements |members = Yes |description = Kill the Crystalline Hunllef with a full set of perfected armour equipped. |tier = Elite |monster = Crystalline Hunllef |type = Restriction |id = 115 |leagueRegion = Tirannwn }} '''Crystalline Warrior''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill the [[Crystalline Hunllef]] with a full set of [[perfected crystal armour]] equipped.
==Strategy== The following materials are required for a full set of perfected armour: * 13 [[linum tirinum]] * 13 [[phren bark]] * 13 [[crystal ore]]s * 540 [[Crystal shards (The Gauntlet)|crystal shards]]
An extra 160 shards are needed for two attuned/perfected weapons, 40 shards for two [[egniol potion]]s, and 40-80 shards for one or two extra [[teleport crystal]]s. This makes for a total of 780-820 shards needed.
In order to maximise efficiency during the preparation phase, the player can use the following tactics: * Do not make two perfected weapons, unless you are confident that you have enough time to spare. * If you are not confident with prayer management, it is possible to grab a third [[grym leaf]] to make a third egniol potion if needed. * Do not collect more than 8 fish. With a full set of perfected armour, very little food is needed for the fight. * Attack creatures while moving or collecting resources. Prioritise killing [[Crystalline Unicorn|unicorns]], [[Crystalline Scorpion|scorpions]], and [[Crystalline Wolf|wolves]], as they can drop up to 105 shards while being very fast to kill. * Make the most out of each teleport crystal by dropping tools and collecting as many items as possible per trip. When getting the tools again for the next run, do not select each individually but rather choose option 6 in the [[Tool Storage]] and drop the unneeded tools while moving. * Restart the run if you do not obtain a [[weapon frame]] from the rooms next to the starting position.
==Other tasks== {{Combat Achievements list|Crystalline Hunllef}}
{{Combat Achievements}}

{{Infobox Monster |name = Crystalline Wolf |image = [[File:Crystalline Wolf.png|280px]] |release = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |update = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |combat = 74 |size = 2 |examine = A little too scary to be man's best friend. |xpbonus = |max hit = 8 |aggressive = Yes |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Crush]] |attack speed = 4 |hitpoints = 52 |att = 106 |str = 66 |def = 22 |mage = 22 |range = 0 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 0 |dslash = 0 |dcrush = 0 |dmagic = 0 |dlight = 0 |dstandard = 0 |dheavy = 0 |poisonresistance = 100 |venomresistance = 100 |id = 9031 |leagueRegion = Tirannwn }} '''Crystalline Wolves''' are mid-level monsters found in the [[Gauntlet]]. Their counterpart in the [[The Gauntlet#Corrupted Gauntlet|Corrupted Gauntlet]] is the [[Corrupted Wolf]]. Mid-level monsters always spawn in pairs, if they spawn in a room.
