{{External|rs|rsc}} {{otheruses|the normal cup of tea|the stat boosting tea made in Player-owned houses|Cup of tea (Player-owned house)|other uses|Tea}} {{Infobox Item |name = Cup of tea |image = [[File:Cup of tea.png]] |release = [[23 July]] [[2002]] |update = Members' quests |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drink, Drop |examine = A nice cup of tea. |value = 10 |weight = 0.150 |respawn = 100 |exchange = Yes |id = 1978 }} [[File:Cup of tea detail.png|left|130px]] A '''cup of tea''' is a [[Drinks|drink]] which restores 3 [[Hitpoints]] and temporarily boosts [[Attack]] by 2 + 2% (rounded down); it will also instantly cancel the effect of the [[goading potion]]. Upon drinking a cup of tea, the player will exclaim {{overhead|Aaah, nothing like a nice cuppa tea!}} and an [[empty cup]] will remain in the player's inventory.
Tea may be purchased at [[Ye olde Tea Shoppe.|Ye olde Tea Shoppe]] in [[Varrock]] or stolen at the nearby [[Tea stall]] with 5 [[Thieving]].
A [[tea flask]] may be used to store up to five cups of tea, which will have the standard effect when consumed. ===Attack Boost=== <math>\lfloor AttackLevel \times 0.02\rfloor + 2</math> {| class="wikitable" style="text-align:center" !{{SCP|Attack}} Level!!Boost |- |'''1-49'''||+2 |- |'''50-99'''||+3 |}
==Quest uses== *A cup of tea is used in [[the Dig Site]] [[quest]] to bribe the [[Panning Guide]] in order to use the panning area found in the [[Dig Site]]. *[[Nettle tea]], a variation of standard tea, is created in [[Ghosts Ahoy]] for the [[Old Crone]]. *Tea can also be found when speaking to [[Galahad]] by the forest north of [[Ardougne]]. *An [[empty cup]] is used in the quest [[One Small Favour]].
