{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Spell |name = Cure Group |image = [[File:Cure Group.png]] |release = [[24 July]] [[2006]] |update = Lunar Diplomacy |members = Yes |level = 74 |spellbook = Lunar |type = Combat |exp = 74 |cost = {{RuneReq|Astral=2|Law=2|Cosmic=2}} |description = Cure poison on players |anim = [[File:Cure Group.gif|180px]] |sound = [[File:Cure Group.ogg]] }} [[File:Cure Group icon (mobile).png|left]] '''Cure Group''' is a [[spell]] in the [[lunar spellbook]] requiring the [[Lunar Diplomacy]] [[quest]] and 74 [[Magic]] to use. It functions similarly to the [[Cure Me]] spell, curing poison from all [[player]]s within 1 square radius of the caster. Players must have '''Accept Aid''' turned on to benefit from this spell.
This spell is used by [[clan]]s and [[pking]] teams and is useful for [[Tai Bwo Wannai Cleanup]], the [[TzHaar Fight Pit]], or other team-based activities.
