Cured yak-hides can be crafted into [[yak-hide legs]] and [[yak-hide body|yak-hide bodies]] with the use of a [[needle]] and [[thread]]. Yak-hide legs require one cured yak-hide and 43 [[Crafting]], while yak-hide bodies require two cured yak-hides and 46 Crafting. Each item gives 32 Crafting experience upon creation, which is unusual, as usually when crafting with hides the experience granted is based on the amount of hides used. ==Creation== {{Recipe |notes = {{SCP|Quest}} Partial completion of [[The Fremennik Isles]] |members = Yes |ticks = 1 |facilities = Thakkrad Sigmundson |mat1 = Yak-hide |mat2 = Coins |mat2quantity = 5 |mat2cost = 1 |output1 = Cured yak-hide }} ==Products== {{Uses material list|Cured yak-hide}} ==Shop locations== {{Store locations list|Cured yak-hide}}
