{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Curry sapling |image = [[File:Curry sapling.png]] |release = [[11 July]] [[2005]] |update = Farming |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = This sapling is ready to be replanted in a fruit tree patch. |value = 1 |weight = 0.907 |exchange = Yes |id = 5499 }} [[File:Curry sapling detail.png|left|150x150px]] '''Curry saplings''' are [[saplings]] that can be used to grow [[curry trees]] at level 42 [[Farming]].
They can be made by planting a [[curry tree seed]] in a [[filled plant pot]], with a [[gardening trowel]] in your inventory, and then watering the [[curry seedling]] with a [[watering can]] or by using [[Humidify]]. When watered, the seedling will sprout into a sapling in one crop cycle (0-5 minutes).
Planting the sapling in a [[Farming/Patch locations#Fruit tree patches|fruit tree patch]], with a spade in your inventory, will give 40 Farming experience. It will grow into a [[curry tree]] after 960 minutes (16 hours), which gives 2,906.9 Farming experience.
Players can ask the [[GAG|gardener]] to protect their tree from [[Disease (Farming)|disease]] whilst it grows, which requires payment of 5 [[bananas|baskets of bananas]]. This payment can be noted.
A [[Curry leaf|curry tree's leaves]] can be used with [[uncooked stew]] to make [[curry]].
