{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Curry tree seed |image = [[File:Curry tree seed 1.png]] [[File:Curry tree seed 2.png]] [[File:Curry tree seed 3.png]] [[File:Curry tree seed 4.png]] [[File:Curry tree seed 5.png]] |release = [[6 June]] [[2005]] |update = Seeds, Bankspace And Advisors |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = Plant in a plantpot of soil to grow a sapling. |value = 39 |weight = 0.000 |exchange = Yes |id = 5286 }} [[File:Curry tree seed detail.png|left|180px]] '''Curry tree seeds''' may be grown into a [[curry tree]] which gives [[Curry leaf|curry leaves]]. Curry tree seeds are obtained from [[bird nest]]s or by trading. Players must have level 42 [[Farming]] to plant this seed, and planting a [[Curry sapling]] into a [[fruit tree patch]] gives 40 Farming [[experience]]. It takes 5–6 minutes for the potted curry tree seed to mature into a sapling and 960 minutes (16 hours) for the planted sapling to become a full curry tree. After it is fully grown, checking the health yields 2,906.9 experience.
A nearby gardener will watch over your growing curry tree at the cost of a payment of 5 [[Bananas|baskets of bananas]].
