{{Infobox Item |name = Cursed goblin bow |image = [[File:Cursed goblin bow.png]] |release = [[23 August]] [[2013]] |update = Goblin Raids: Taking down the High Priest |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wield, Drop |examine = A curse has been placed on this bow. |value = 30 |weight = 1.814 |id = 11708 }} [[File:Cursed goblin bow detail.png|left|130px]] The '''cursed goblin bow''' is one of the three [[cursed goblin weapon]]s released during the [[Goblin Invasion]] event. It was originally a drop from the [[goblin lieutenant]]s found in the cave that the [[Varrock]] [[Scout (2013 Goblin Invasion)|scout]] led you to, and it was very powerful when used against [[goblin]]s fought during the event. It can now be bought from [[Diango]] in [[Draynor Village]] for 45 [[coins]].
It can shoot arrows up to [[Iron arrow|iron]], although it is slower than a regular [[shortbow]] and offers no accuracy bonuses. Since it has no requirements to wield, its bright colour makes it a popular choice for [[skiller]]s that want to avoid accidentally attacking NPCs.
