{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Construction |version1 = Regular |version2 = Christmas |version3 = Wall decoration |name1 = Curtains |name2 = Christmas Curtains |name3 = Wall decoration |image1 = [[File:Curtains built.png|250px]] |image2 = [[File:Curtains (Goblin decorations) built.png|250px]] |image3 = [[File:Wall decoration (Curtains) built.png|250px]] |icon1 = [[File:Curtains icon.png]] |icon2 = N/A |icon3 = N/A |furniturename1 = Regular |furniturename2 = Christmas |furniturename3 = Wall decoration |release1 = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |release2 = [[9 December]] [[2020]] |release3 = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |update1 = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |update2 = Christmas 2020 |update3 = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |level = 18 |experience1 = 225 |experience2 = 0 |experience3 = 225 |room = [[Parlour]], [[bedroom]], [[dining room]], [[portal nexus]] |hotspot = [[Curtain space]] |flatpack = No |examine1 = The curtain is open. |examine2 = Seasonally decorated. |examine3 = An oak decoration to make the wall less bare. |id1 = 6775 |id2 = 40772 |id3 = 6778 |itemid = 8323 }} The '''curtains''' can be built in the [[curtain space]] of the [[parlour]], [[bedroom]], [[dining room]], and [[portal nexus]] in a [[player-owned house]]. It requires 18 [[Construction]] to build and gives 225 [[experience]] when built. The player must have a [[hammer]] and a [[saw]] in their inventory to build it. The [[goblin decorations]] can be used on curtains to make Christmas curtains.
If another room is placed behind a pair of curtain hotspots such that it blocks the windows, the windows and curtains will be replaced with a wall decoration depending on the type of curtains. These wall decorations are not available to be built in regular [[Decoration space|decoration hotspots]].
