'''Cute creatures''' are six-legged creatures initially found in the [[Tree Gnome Stronghold]] and [[Tree Gnome Village (location)|Tree Gnome Village]]. There are six cute creatures in the Stronghold and one in the village. Later, during [[The Eyes of Glouphrie]], they are revealed to be disguised [[evil creature]]s. The Village cute creature is exposed during  [[The Path of Glouphrie]].
[[File:Izzie is evil.png|thumb|left|Izzie's cuteness illusion is dispelled...]]

