'''Cutlasses''' are an uncommon type of medium-speed, one-handed [[Melee]] [[slash weapon]] similar to [[scimitar]]s. Unlike scimitars however, they have some defensive bonuses similar to [[claws]] and [[spear]]s, and negative [[Magic]] attack bonuses similar to [[halberd]]s.

