A solitary '''cyclops''' is located in a cage in the [[Ardougne Zoo]]. Unlike all other [[cyclops|cyclopes]], this cyclops has the same drop table as a regular [[hill giant]]. 

According to the [[Zoo keeper]], this cyclops was brought to the zoo by an explorer from a [[Wushanko Isles|far away land]], but little else is known because the explorer died shortly thereafter.{{CiteNPC|npc=Zoo keeper|loc=Ardougne Zoo|quote=He's from a very far away land. We couldn't find out more as the explorer who brought him back died shortly afterwards!}}

