'''Cylinder piles''' are found within the [[Mage Training Arena]]'s [[Mage Training Arena/Enchanting Chamber|Enchanting Chamber]]. Players can search the pile to receive a [[cylinder]], yielding between 1 and 9 enchantment points depending on which enchantment spell is used on the cylinder, and whether the bonus points are active. There is a 1/32 chance to receive a [[dragonstone (Mage Training Arena)|dragonstone]] instead of a cylinder whilst searching.

