{{external|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Cyrisus's chest |image = [[File:Cyrisus's chest.png]] |release = [[15 May]] [[2007]] |update = Dream Mentor |members = Yes |quest = [[Dream Mentor]] |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Look-in, Destroy |destroy = You'll have to get another from 'Bird's-Eye' Jack at the Lunar Isle bank. |examine = Perfect for storing heavy things. |value = 1 |alchable = No |weight = 0.600 |id = 11158 }} [[File:Cyrisus's chest detail.png|left|150px]] '''Cyrisus's chest''' is an item used in [[Dream Mentor]] to [[Dream Mentor#Regeneration|carry Cyrisus's armour to him]] from the bank, to aid in restoring [[Cyrisus]]'s Armament meter to 100%. It is obtained from [['Bird's-Eye' Jack]] who works at the [[Lunar Isle]] bank since the player has started the quest and has gotten Cyrisus on his feet.
Much like Cyrisus's bank, the items inside the chest cannot be obtained in anyway by opening or destroying it.
If a player attempts to cast alchemy spells on it, the chatbox will state ''You can't do that to the property of the bank.'' {{Dream Mentor}}

{{Infobox NPC |name = D3ad1i F15her |image = [[File:D3ad1i F15her.png|240px]] |release = [[6 October]] [[2021]] |update = Group Ironman |level = 13 |members = No |race = [[Human]] |location = [[The Node]] |gender = Male |options = Talk-to, Trade |examine = A menace to all fish. |map = {{Map|name=D3ad1i F15her|x=3114|y=3045|r=3|mtype=square}} |id = 11225 |leagueRegion = Misthalin }} [[File:D3ad1i F15her chathead.png|left]] '''D3ad1i F15her''' is a [[player spoof|spoof]] of a [[Hardcore group ironman]] found [[Fishing]] off the docks connecting the northern and central islands of [[The Node]]. As the name implies, all he does is fish.
