{{External|rs}} {{Infobox NPC |version1 = Before Quest |version2 = After Quest |name = Daero |image = [[File:Daero.png|120px]] |release1 = [[6 December]] [[2004]] |release2 = [[2 August]] [[2013]] |update1 = Monkey Madness |update2 = Patch Notes (2 August 2013) |members = Yes |race = [[Gnome]] |quest = [[Monkey Madness I]] |location = On the {{FloorNumber|uk=1}} of the Grand Tree at Blurberry's Bar |gender = Male |options1 = Talk-to |options2 = Talk-to, Travel |examine = Daero gives off an easy sense of authority. |map = {{Map|name=Daero|x=2484|y=3487|plane=1|r=3|mtype=square}} |id1 = 1444 |id2 = 1445 |leagueRegion = Kandarin }} [[File:Daero chathead.png|left]] '''Daero''' is the new tree guardian of the [[Tree Gnome Stronghold]], who is found at Blurberry's Bar on the {{FloorNumber|uk=1}} of the Grand Tree. Unlike the former tree guardian, [[Glough]], he is friendly towards humans and other non-gnomes. Daero plays an important role in the [[Monkey Madness I]] quest, as he is the gnome that blindfolds and escorts the player to the [[Underground Military Glider Hangar|hangar]], which houses the glider that flies the player to [[Crash Island]].
==Daero's Training==
After completion of [[Monkey Madness I]] you can speak to him again in the Tree Gnome Stronghold to receive an experience reward in [[Strength]], [[Hitpoints]], [[Attack]], and [[Defence]]. He will give you 20,000 XP in all four skills and let you choose between either [[Strength]] and [[Hitpoints]] or [[Attack]] and [[Defence]] to receive an extra 15,000 XP for.
