{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Daeyalt ore |image = [[File:Daeyalt ore.png]] |release = [[4 September]] [[2006]] |update = Myreque Pt III - Darkness of Hallowvale |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = This needs refining. |value = 100 |weight = 2.267 |id = 9632 }} [[File:Daeyalt ore detail.png|left|130px]] '''Daeyalt ore''' is a rare [[ore]] that can only be mined from [[daeyalt rocks]] by players with 20 [[Mining]] during and after the [[Darkness of Hallowvale]] quest. It cannot be [[smelt]]ed into a bar using the [[Smithing]] skill.
Daeyalt ore is found in the [[Meiyerditch mine]] in north-western [[Meiyerditch]] in the [[Sanguinesti]] region and in the [[Daeyalt essence mine]] in [[Darkmeyer]]. A player gets 3 ores from each rock wall.
If players are sent to the [[Meiyerditch mine]] by the [[Vyrewatch]] in [[Meiyerditch]], they must mine 15 ores and place them in the [[Mine cart (Meiyerditch mine)|mine cart]], then ask a nearby [[Vampyre Juvinate (Meiyerditch mine)|vampyre juvinate]] to be released from the mine. This can be skipped by talking to the juvinate while wearing a [[vyre noble outfit]], requiring partial completion of [[Sins of the Father]].
==Mining Info== {{Mining info |name = Daeyalt rocks |level = 20 |xp = 17.5 |rock = [[Daeyalt rocks]] |tool = [[Pickaxe]] |time = 28 seconds }}
