Players must mine 15 daeyalt ore to be released from the [[Meiyerditch mine]] after being sent there by the [[Vyrewatch]] in [[Meiyerditch]]. This can be skipped if the player is wearing a [[vyre noble outfit]], requiring partial completion of [[Sins of the Father]].

