{{Gone}} {{Infobox Monster |name = Dagannoth Prime (Echo) |image = [[File:Dagannoth Prime (Echo).png|190px]] |release = [[27 November]] [[2024]] |update = Leagues V: Raging Echoes OUT NOW! |removal = [[22 January]] [[2025]] |removalupdate = Bank QoL & Mini Menu Improvements |members = Yes |combat = 454 |size = 3 |examine = A legendary dagannoth king, rumoured to fly on the North winds. |attributes = <!-- if no monster attributes apply, remove this parameter --> |xpbonus = |max hit = At least 49 |aggressive = Yes |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Magic]] |attack speed = 5 |slaylvl = None |slayxp = 727 |cat = Bosses, Dagannoth |assignedby = vannaka,chaeldar,konar,nieve,duradel |hitpoints = 1800 |att = 255 |str = 255 |def = 255 |mage = 400 |range = 0 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 255 |dslash = 255 |dcrush = 255 |dmagic = 255 |dlight = 10 |dstandard = 10 |dheavy = 10 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 100 |id = |leagueRegion = Fremennik }} '''Echo Dagannoth Prime''' is a more challenging variant of [[Dagannoth Prime]] that was accessible during the [[Raging Echoes League]]. To fight the Echo Dagannoth Kings the player must use a [[Fremennik echo orb]], which is dropped by the regular [[Dagannoth Kings]]. The kings share a health bar of 1800. During the fight, two of them will use protection prayers against all styles. As such, it is best to damage the king with no protection prayers overhead. After a certain amount of damage, poison will scatter over random tiles and the kings will rotate which 2 have protection prayers activated. Near the end in the enrage phase, they will all drop their protection prayers and the random poison tiles increase frequently. It is similar to the sunlight beams of during the Sol Heredit fight. When they are killed you will complete the CA tasks of "Rapid Succession" and "Toppling the Diarchy". On death each king rolls their standard drop table.
The unique drops of the Echo Dagannoth Kings are the [[Amulet of the monarchs]] and [[Emperor ring]], powerful pieces of jewellery with bonuses in every stat.
