{{Gone}} {{Infobox Monster |name = Dagannoth Rex (Echo) |image = [[File:Dagannoth Rex (Echo).png|190px]] |release = [[27 November]] [[2024]] |update = Leagues V: Raging Echoes OUT NOW! |removal = [[22 January]] [[2025]] |removalupdate = Bank QoL & Mini Menu Improvements |members = Yes |combat = 454 |size = 3 |examine = Firstborn of the legendary dagannoth kings. |attributes = <!-- if no monster attributes apply, remove this parameter --> |xpbonus = |max hit = at least 48 |aggressive = Yes |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Slash]] |attack speed = 5 |slaylvl = None |slayxp = 727 |cat = Bosses, Dagannoth |assignedby = vannaka,chaeldar,konar,nieve,duradel |hitpoints = 1800 |att = 400 |str = 400 |def = 255 |mage = 0 |range = 255 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 255 |dslash = 255 |dcrush = 255 |dmagic = 10 |dlight = 255 |dstandard = 255 |dheavy = 255 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 100 |id = |leagueRegion = Fremennik }} '''Echo Dagannoth Rex''' is a more challenging variant of [[Dagannoth Rex]] that was accessible during the [[Raging Echoes League]]. To fight the Echo Dagannoth Kings the player must have a [[Fremennik echo orb]], which is dropped by the regular [[Dagannoth Kings]], in their inventory. The kings share a health bar of 1800. During the fight, two of them will use protection prayers against all styles. It is best to damage the king with no overheads. After a certain amount of damage poison will scatter over random tiles and the kings will rotate which 2 have overhead prayers activated. Near the end in the enrage phase, they will all drop their overheads and the random poison tiles increase frequently. It is similar to the sunlight beams of during the [[Sol Heredit]] fight. When they are killed you will complete the Combat Achievements of "[[Rapid Succession]]" and "[[Toppling the Diarchy]]". On death each king rolls their standard drop table.
The unique drops of the Echo Dagannoth Kings are the [[Amulet of the monarchs]] and [[Emperor ring]], powerful pieces of jewellery with bonuses in every stat.
