{{External|rs}} {{Otheruses|def=no|the race|Dagannoth (race)}} {{Infobox Monster |name = Dagannoth fledgeling |image = [[File:Dagannoth fledgeling.png|280px]] |release = [[7 November]] [[2005]] |update = Waterbirth Island - deeper, darker, deadlier! |members = Yes |combat = 70 |size = 2 |examine = A knee-high horror from the ocean depths... |xpbonus = -100 |max hit = 6 |aggressive = No |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Stab]] |attack speed = 4 |respawn = 30 |slayxp = 0 |cat = Dagannoth |assignedby = vannaka,chaeldar,konar,nieve,duradel |hitpoints = 100 |att = 50 |str = 50 |def = 50 |mage = 1 |range = 1 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 0 |dslash = 0 |dcrush = 0 |dmagic = 0 |dlight = 0 |dstandard = 0 |dheavy = 0 |elementalweaknesstype = Earth |elementalweaknesspercent = 35 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 0 |immunecannon = No |immunethrall = No |id = 2264 }} '''Dagannoth fledgelings''' are found in the room with the Fremennik [[Bardur]] inside the [[Waterbirth Island]] dungeon, near the [[Dagannoth King]]s.
Dagannoth fledgelings are bad for training as although they won't attack players (being too busy with Bardur) and they have high [[hitpoints]], they provide no combat or [[Slayer]] experience. Another downside is that they are located deep in the [[Waterbirth Island Dungeon]].
Dagannoth fledgelings are located near [[Bardur]], who will give cooked [[shark]]s in exchange for [[Fremennik shield]]s, [[Fremennik blade|blades]], and [[Fremennik helm|helmets]]. This can help to prolong a stay at the dungeon.
