{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Scenery |version1 = Regular |version2 = Cooks' Guild |version3 = Hosidius & Sinclair Mansion |version4 = Prifddinas |name = Dairy churn |image1 = [[File:Dairy churn (regular).png|250x250px]] |image2 = [[File:Dairy churn (Cooks' Guild).png|250x250px]] |image3 = [[File:Dairy churn (Hosidius & Sinclair Mansion).png|250x250px]] |image4 = [[File:Dairy churn (Prifddinas).png|250x250px]] |release1 = [[24 October]] [[2005]] |release2 = [[24 October]] [[2005]] |release3 = [[24 July]] [[2007]] |release4 = [[25 July]] [[2019]] |update1 = Mogres, Lizards, Pet Fish, Potions and Potatoes! |update2 = Mogres, Lizards, Pet Fish, Potions and Potatoes! |update3 = King's Ransom |update4 = Song of the Elves |members = Yes |quest = No |location1 = ''Varies'' |location2 = [[Cooks' Guild]] |location3 = ''Varies'' |location4 = [[Prifddinas]] |options = Churn |examine = Turns milk into other dairy products. |map = No |id1 = 11695 |id2 = 11696 |id3 = 25720 |id4 = 35937 }} '''Dairy churns''' are used in the [[Cooking]] [[Skills|skill]] to turn [[Bucket of milk|milk]] obtained from a [[dairy cow]] into a [[pot of cream]], a [[pat of butter]], or some [[cheese]].
You can also turn a pot of cream into a pat of butter or cheese and turn a pat of butter into cheese by using them on the churn. When processing buckets of milk into other kinds of dairy with a full inventory, the product will automatically drop on the ground after the desired product has been churned.
A [[Bottomless milk bucket]] can be used in place of a [[Bucket of milk]] for a less click intensive and more AFK skilling method for training cooking.
