'''Dalldav''' is an [[elf]] who runs the [[Lletya Archery Shop]] in the rebel elf settlement of [[Lletya]]. Dalldav provides the elves in Lletya with weaponry, but also sells his wares to human adventurers, carrying iron, steel, mithril, adamant, and rune [[arrows]], as well as [[bronze bolts]], [[crossbows]], [[oak shortbow]]s, [[oak longbow]]s, [[willow shortbow]]s and [[willow longbow]]s.

