{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Damaged book |image = [[File:Damaged book (Ancient).png]] |release = [[3 July]] [[2014]] |update = Halos, God Books & Stamina |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wield, Check, Drop |examine = An incomplete book of a forgotten god. |value = 200 |weight = 1.000 |id = 12611 }} [[File:Damaged book (Ancient) detail.png|left|130x130px]] The '''damaged book''' is a book held in the shield slot that can be obtained for 5,000 [[coins]] from [[Jossik]] after completing [[Horror from the Deep]]. The four [[Ancient page (God_page)|Ancient pages]] can be added to upgrade it to the [[book of darkness]], which gives an accuracy bonus. Both the damaged and upgraded book count as a [[god item]] for [[Zaros]] in the [[God Wars Dungeon]].
After completing Horror from the Deep, you are rewarded with a damaged book of your choice: either Saradomin, Guthix, or Zamorak. You '''do not''' need to complete your current damaged book before obtaining a new one of a different type from Jossik. You can buy every damaged book in the same day. Dropping or destroying a damaged book and talking to Jossik results in him returning it to you.
You can check which pages are currently in your incomplete book with the "Check" option. Once you have filled the book, you cannot take the pages out.
