{{Infobox Spell |name = Dark Demonbane |image = [[File:Dark Demonbane.png]] |release = [[16 June]] [[2021]] |update = A Kingdom Divided |members = Yes |level = 82 |spellbook = Arceuus |type = Combat |exp = 43.5 |damage = 30 |cost = {{RuneReq|Fire=7|Soul=2}} |speed = 5 ticks |quest = [[A Kingdom Divided]] |description = Hits a demon for major damage |anim = [[File:Dark Demonbane.gif|250px]] |sound = [[File:Dark Demonbane.ogg]] }} [[File:Dark Demonbane icon (mobile).png|left]] '''Dark Demonbane''' is a spell within the [[Arceuus spellbook]] that requires level 82 [[Magic]] and the completion of [[A Kingdom Divided]] to be cast. This spell has a base max hit of 30 but can only be cast on [[Demon (attribute)|demonic]] creatures.
By default, [[demonbane spells]] have an accuracy bonus of 20% but can be doubled to 40% when the [[Mark of Darkness]] spell is active, which additionally gives a 25% damage bonus. If attacking with a [[purging staff]], this is further doubled to an 80% accuracy and 50% damage bonus when under the effects of the Mark of Darkness. All of these bonuses are calculated after the player's own [[magic damage]] bonuses from their equipment.
