{{Infobox Set |name = Dark Squall robes |image = [[File:Dark_squall_hood.png]] [[File:Dark_squall_robe_top.png]] [[File:Dark_squall_robe_bottom.png]] |members = Yes |quest = [[While Guthix Sleeps]] |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |store = No }} [[File:Dark squall hood chathead.png|left]] '''Dark Squall robes''' are a set of [[magic robes]] obtained during the [[While Guthix Sleeps]] quest. They offer offensive and defensive Magic stats better than that of [[Wizard robes]] but worse than that of [[Xerician robes]]. After completion of the quest, the player can reobtain the Dark Squall robes for free from [[Silif]] at the [[White Knights' Castle]] if they have lost them. They can be stored in the [[magic wardrobe]] of the [[costume room]] in a [[player-owned house]].
These robes are [[Zamorak#Affiliated items|Zamorak affiliated items]], including when worn in the [[God Wars Dungeon]]. They can also be used to enter the [[Black Knights' Fortress (location)|Black Knights' Fortress]].
The Dark Squall robes are '''always''' kept on death, even if they are not one of the player's three most valuable items. Additionally, unlike many other untradeable items, the robes will not be deleted when killed by another player above level 20 [[Wilderness]].
{{clear|left}}
{| class="wikitable align-center-1" ! colspan="2" |Item !Examine |- |{{plinkt|Dark squall hood}}||A hood worn by the Dark Squall. |- |{{plinkt|Dark squall robe top}}||A robe worn by the Dark Squall. |- |{{plinkt|Dark squall robe bottom}}||A robe worn by the Dark Squall. |}
==Bonuses== There are no set bonuses when wearing all three components of the Dark Squall robes. However, players who wear the full set can negate the [[aggresiveness|aggressiveness]] of the [[Elite Black Knight]]s within the [[Black Knight Catacombs]].
