==Searching the crate==
===Before unlocking the icy key door===
* {{tcond|If the player already has the ancient map:}}
** {{tbox|You search the crate, but find nothing of interest.}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player has no inventory space:}}
** {{tbox|pic=Ancient map detail.png|You search the crate and find an old map inside, but you don't have enough room to take it.}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tbox|pic=Ancient map detail.png|You search the crate and find an old map inside.}}
* {{tact|end}}

===After unlocking the icy key door===
* {{tbox|You have no reason to do that.}}
* {{tact|end}}

