{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
===If the player is a house guest===
* '''Player:''' Hey, a crawling hand!
* '''Crawling hand:''' Yes, what?
* '''Player:''' [House owner] must be pretty handy to have slayed that!
* {{tact|end}}

===If the player is the house owner===
* {{trandom}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
** '''Player:''' Hey, I was going to make some furniture, do you think you could lend a HAND?
** '''Crawling hand:''' Very funny.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Player:''' Hey, hand, do you want to know how I slayed you?
** '''Crawling hand:''' I don't know, how?
** '''Player:''' Because you're just a hand! You're ARMLESS!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
** '''Player:''' Hey, you're just a hand, right? So what do you eat?
** '''Crawling hand:''' Finger food, of course!
** {{tact|end}}

