{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Crefydd:''' Hello there. Have you come to reflect?
* '''Player:''' I'm not sure.
* {{tcond|If the player's respawn point is not in [[Prifddinas]]:}}
** '''Crefydd:''' It's not for everyone. You are always welcome to pray to Seren here if you wish though. If you prefer, I can offer you the ability to respawn in Prifddinas upon death.
** {{tselect|Select an Option}}
** {{topt|Yes please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes please.
*** '''Crefydd:''' Then it shall be so. From now on, you will respawn in Prifddinas.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|No thanks.}}
*** '''Player:''' No thanks.
*** '''Crefydd:''' As you wish. I'll be here if you change your mind.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player's respawn point is in [[Prifddinas]]:}}
** '''Crefydd:''' It's not for everyone. You are always welcome to pray to Seren here if you wish though. If you prefer, I can revert your respawn point to Lumbridge.
** {{tselect|Select an Option}}
** {{topt|Yes please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes please.
*** '''Crefydd:''' Then it shall be so. From now on, you will respawn in Lumbridge.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|No thanks.}}
*** '''Player:''' No thanks.
*** '''Crefydd:''' As you wish. If you ever tire of respawning in Prifddinas, just let me know.
*** {{tact|end}}

