{{Transcript|NPC}}

==Standard dialogue==
* {{trandom}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
** '''Player:''' What are you drinking?
** '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' Blood!
** '''Player:''' How are you getting drunk on blood?
** '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' They keep some of the tithes drunk all the time and then take it from them.
** '''Player:''' How very creative.
** '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' I know right! Bloody brilliant!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Player:''' Hello.
** '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' I'll have a pint please.
** '''Player:''' I don't work here.
** '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' Sure you do!
** '''Player:''' No, I really don't.
** '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' Well clear off then.
** {{tact|end}}

===If the player is not disguised===
* '''Crimsonette van Marr:''' Human! Get back to the slave pens before I call the guards!
* {{tact|end}}

