* '''Player:''' Rather?
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' [player name]...
* '''Player:''' Yes?
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' When the darkness falls upon you, do you see the spires of the eternal city? When you look upon it, do you hear the songs from within?
* '''Player:''' Are you alright?!
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' The choir sings in unison... but the song is one of silence. It cuts through the waves and pierces the veil, until only one question remains...
* '''Player:''' What is this?!
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Oh, sorry about that. I lost my train of thought for a moment there.
* '''Player:''' Are... you sure? You said some strange things a moment ago.
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Hmm? I was just talking about how you keep finding things with these rather strange phrases on them. Slightly chilling, isn't it?
* '''Player:''' Slightly chilling... yeah...
* {{tact|end}}

