{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
===Before completion of [[In Search of the Myreque]]===
* '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Hello there friend. I'm afraid all boat rides are out of service due to the high ghast activity in Mort Myre.
* {{tact|end}}

===Attempting to use his boat===
* '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Hey, hands off my boat!
* {{tact|end}}

===After completion of [[In Search of the Myreque]]===
*'''Player:''' Thanks for your help in finding the Myreque.
*'''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Well, I'd like to say that you're welcome. But I heard that you led Vanstrom straight to their hideout. I feel so guilty.
*'''Player:''' Hmm, yeah, I know how you feel.
* {{tact|end}}

===After completion of [[Sins of the Father]]===
* '''Player:''' Thanks for your help in finding the Myreque.
* '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Well, I'd like to say that you're welcome. But what does it matter now? The Drakans killed the whole lot of them.
* {{tact|end}}

==When boarding the [[Swamp Boaty]]==
* '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' I'll have to charge you 10 gold to cover the loan of the boat. Is that okay?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Yes. I'll pay the ten gold.}}
** '''Player:''' Yes. I'll pay the ten gold.
** {{tcond|If the player does not have 10 gold:}}
*** '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Sorry, but you don't have that much. No money, no boat!
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tbox|You board the boat and journey to the Hollows.}}
** {{tbox|You arrive at the Hollows.}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No. I won't use the boat.}}
** '''Player:''' No. I won't use the boat.
* {{topt|cond=If the player has a [[Ring of Charos]]:|[Charm] How about you let me use the boat for free?}}
** '''Player:''' How about you let me use the boat for free?
** '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Hmm, use the boat for free... Very well, that sounds fair enough to me.
** {{tact|end}}
==When quick-boarding the [[Swamp Boaty]]==
* {{tcond|If the player does not have 10 gold:}}
** '''Cyreg Paddlehorn:''' Sorry my friend. You don't seem to have the funds for the trip. It will cost you 10 gold.
* {{tbox|You board the boat and journey to the Hollows.}}
* {{tbox|You arrive at the Hollows.}}
* {{tact|end}}

