{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Daga:''' Would you like to buy or sell some scimitars?
* {{topt|Yes, please.}}
** '''Player:''' Yes, please.
** {{tact|opens=Daga's Scimitar Smithy}}
* {{topt|No, thanks.}}
** '''Player:''' No, thanks.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Do you have any Dragon Scimitars in stock?}}
** '''Player:''' Do you have any Dragon Scimitars in stock?
** '''Daga:''' It just so happens I recently got a fresh delivery, do you want to buy one?
** {{topt|Yes, please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes, please.
*** {{tcond|If the player has at least 100,000 coins:}}
**** {{tact|receives=a dragon scimitar for 100,000 coins}}
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have at least 100,000 coins:}}
**** '''Daga:''' Sorry but you don't have enough to buy one, at the moment it costs 100000 gold coins.
**** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|No, thanks.}}
*** '''Player:''' No, thanks.
*** {{tact|end}}

==Treasure Trails==
===Elite===
* {{tcond|When given another clue scroll:}}
** {{tact|receives=another [[Clue scroll (elite)|clue scroll]]}}
** {{tbox|pic=Clue scroll (elite) detail.png|You've been given a new clue!}}
** '''Daga:''' Here, have this!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|When given a reward casket:}}
** {{tact|receives=an [[Reward casket (elite)|elite reward casket]]}}
** {{tbox|pic=Reward casket (elite) detail.png|You've obtained a casket!}}
** {{tact|above}}

