==Standard dialogue==
* '''Dalldav:''' Can I help you at all?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Yes please. What are you selling?}}
** {{tact|opens=Lletya Archery Shop}}
* {{topt|Why do you sell this stuff?}}
** '''Player:''' Why do you sell this stuff? The Crystal Bow is so much better.
** '''Dalldav:''' We keep all these old toys to train our children with, but if people will part with coins for them, then they are theirs!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No thanks.}}
** '''Player:''' No thanks.
** {{tact|end}}

