{{Transcript|npc}}

==Initial dialogue==
* '''Player:''' Hello stranger.
* '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
* '''Player:''' Ah very friendly I see. What's that coffin on your back?
* '''Dampe:''' For carryin' the dead.
* '''Player:''' Woah, don't tell me you have a body in there?
* '''Dampe:''' No, remains.
* '''Player:''' Oh, you carry the remains of shades in it? Could you give me one?
* '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
* {{tbox|Dampe hands you a broken coffin.}}
* '''Player:''' It's broken? What am I suppose{{sic}} to do with a broken coffin?
* '''Dampe:''' Bring me locks, find in the catacombs... I repair coffin with locks.
* '''Player:''' Right... Guess I should head into the catacombs then... see if I can find any of these 'locks'.
* '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
* {{tact|end}}

==Subsequent dialogue==
* '''Player:''' Hello again.
* '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
* '''Player:''' Ah, as cheerful as ever I see.
* '''Dampe:''' What d'ya want.
* {{topt|Ask about locks.}}
** {{tcond|If the player has no locks in their inventory:}}
*** '''Player:''' You gave me a broken coffin, what am I suppose{{sic}} to do with it?
*** '''Dampe:''' Bring me locks, I fix coffin with locks...
*** '''Player:''' Right... and where am I suppose to find such locks?
*** '''Dampe:''' In catacombs... in chests...
*** '''Player:''' Great, thanks for the information.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has locks in their inventory:}}
*** '''Player:''' I found one of the locks you were talking about, I think.
*** {{tbox|You show Dampe the lock you found and his cold eyes light up.}}
*** '''Dampe:''' That is it, give to me now and I repair the coffin.
*** {{tselect|Give Dampe a lock?}}
*** {{topt|Yes}}
**** {{tcond|If the player does not have a broken coffin:}}
***** '''Dampe:''' You ain't got no broken coffin for me to fix. If you need one, just ask.
***** {{tact|end}}
**** {{tcond|If the player has a broken coffin:}}
***** {{tbox|You hand over the coffin and lock to Dampe.}}
***** {{tbox|You hear him clumsily attach the lock to the coffin.}}
***** '''Dampe:''' Finished, take it.
***** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|No}}
**** '''Player:''' No thanks, I'm going to hang on to it for now.
**** '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
**** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Ask for another coffin.}}
** '''Player:''' Could I get another of those coffins?
** {{tcond|If the player already has one:}}
*** '''Dampe:''' Get lost, you've already got a coffin, I ain't givin' you anotha.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player does not have one:}}
*** '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
*** {{tbox|Dampe hands you a broken coffin.}}
*** '''Player:''' It's broken?
*** '''Dampe:''' Bring me locks, find in the catacombs... I repair coffin with locks.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Ask about his robes.}}
** '''Player:''' Where did you get those robes?
** '''Dampe:''' Given to me.
** '''Player:''' By who?
** '''Dampe:''' A dead friend of mine.
** '''Player:''' Oh... how did they die?
** '''Dampe:''' In the catacombs.
** '''Player:''' Sorry to hear that...
** '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Just wanted a chat.}}
** '''Player:''' Nothing, I just wanted to chat.
** '''Dampe:''' *grunts*
** {{tact|end}}

==Using broken coffin on Dampe==
===Without locks===
* '''Player:''' Can you fix this for me?
* '''Dampe:''' Depends, you got any locks for it?
* '''Player:''' No...
* '''Dampe:''' Yeah, well clear off them a go find one.
* {{tact|end}}

===With locks===
* '''Player:''' Can you fix this for me?
* '''Dampe:''' Depends, you got any locks for it?
* {{tselect|Give Dampe a lock?}}
* {{topt|Yes}}
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|No}}
** {{tact|above}}

==Using locks on Dampe==
===Without a broken coffin===
* '''Player:''' Hey, I found this lock in the catacombs? Can you do anything with it?
* '''Dampe:''' *grunts* Lets 'ava look.
* '''Dampe:''' You ain't got no broken coffin for me to fix. If you need one, just ask.
* {{tact|end}}

===With a broken coffin===
* '''Player:''' Hey, I found this lock in the catacombs? Can you do anything with it?
* '''Dampe:''' *grunts* Lets 'ava look.
* {{tbox|You hand over the coffin and lock to Dampe.}}
* {{tbox|You hear him clumsily attach the lock to the coffin.}}
* '''Dampe:''' Finished, take it.
* {{tact|end}}

{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Damwin:''' Hiya! Do you want to buy me a drink?
* '''Player:''' I think I'll pass on that.
* '''Damwin:''' Fine, I'm sure somebody else round here will know how to treat a woman...
* {{tact|end}}

==Gnome Restaurant dialogue==
* {{tcond|If the player doesn't have the correct item in their inventory:}}
** {{tbox|Although you have found your customer you don't appear to have brought the correct food with you! You need [a/some] [ordered gnome food/drink item]!}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player has a premade item in their inventory:}}
** {{tbox|Premade dishes will not do I'm afraid. Only hand made Gnome Cuisine is good enough for customers of Aluft Aloft.}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player has the correct item in their inventory:}}
** {{tbox|You hand over your delivery of [a/some] [ordered gnome food/drink item] to Damwin}}
** '''Damwin:''' Ooh, thanks a lot dearie.
** {{tcond|If the player does not have a reward token available:}}
*** {{tbox|You have [number] credits towards your free delivery token. You are not eligible to get gnome food delivered to you yet.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player does have a reward token available:}}
*** {{tbox|You have [number] credits towards your free delivery token. You may get [number] pieces of gnome food delivered to you.}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has an unclaimed reward token:}}
**** {{tbox|Don't forget to pick up your free delivery token from Aluft Gianne jnr.}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has claimed their reward token:}}
**** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player ran out of time:}}
** {{tbox|Your delivery is too late! Go back to Aluft jnr. to get another order. You discard your delivery box as you don't need it any more.}}
** {{tact|end}}

