<!-- Before progressing into underground pass or very far into plague city -->
==Standard dialogue==
* '''Dark Mage:''' Why do you interrupt me, traveller? I am experimenting with dark magic; it is a dangerous craft, and I prefer not to be disturbed.
* '''Player:''' I'm just looking around.
* '''Dark Mage:''' There's nothing to see here, just despair and death.
* {{tact|end}}

===Post-quest dialogue===
* '''Dark Mage:''' Can I help you with something, traveller? I am experimenting with dark magic; it is a dangerous craft, and I prefer not to be disturbed.
* {{tcond|If the player doesn't have any [[Iban's staff|Iban's staves]] in inventory:}}
** '''Player:''' I'll leave you to it.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has an Iban's staff:|Can you recharge my Staff of Iban?}}
** '''Player:''' Can you recharge my Staff of Iban?
** {{tcond|If the Iban staff has full 120 charges left:}}
*** '''Dark Mage:''' Your staff is already as fully charged as it can go.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has less than 100,000 coins:}}
*** '''Dark Mage:''' I'll want 100,000 coins to recharge the Staff of Iban.
*** {{tact|end}}
** '''Player:''' Can you recharge my Staff of Iban?
** {{topt|Pay 100,000 coins to recharge it.}}
*** {{tact|The player pays 100,000 coins. The Dark Mage casts a spell (emote).}}
*** {{tbox|The mage summons the power of Zamorak and recharges your Staff of Iban.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Don't pay.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has an Iban's staff:|Can you upgrade my Staff of Iban?}}
** '''Player:''' Can you upgrade my Staff of Iban?
** '''Dark Mage:''' Hah! Yes, I can upgrade it to hold 2500 charges, enough to cast Iban's magic 2500 times at monsters or 1250 times at people like you. That'll cost you 200,000 coins.
** {{topt|cond=If the player has at least 200,000 coins:|Here's 200,000 coins. Please upgrade the staff.}}
*** {{tmissing}}
** {{topt|Thanks, I'll bear it in mind.}}
*** '''Player:''' Thanks, I'll bear it in mind.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has a broken Iban's staff:|Can you repair my broken Staff of Iban?}}
** '''Player:''' Can you repair my broken Staff of Iban?
** {{tbox|You show the mage your broken staff.}}
** '''Dark Mage:''' The Staff of Iban holds dangerous magic, traveller. I can fix it, but it will cost you - the process could kill me!
** '''Player:''' How much?
** '''Dark Mage:''' 200,000 coins. That'll give it 120 charges, enough to cast Iban's magic 120 times at monsters or 60 times at people like you.
** {{topt|cond=If the player has at least 200,000 coins in inventory:|Here's 200,000 coins. Please repair the staff.}}
*** '''Player:''' Here's 200,000 coins. Please repair the staff.
*** {{tbox|You give the mage 200,000 coins and the staff...}}
*** {{tact|Dark Mage performs a spell (emote).}}
*** {{tbox|You give the mage 200,000 coins and the staff... The mage fixes the staff and returns it to you.}}
*** {{tact|Player loses 200,000 coins.}}
*** {{tact|receives=Iban's staff}}
*** '''Player:''' Thanks, I appreciate that.
*** '''Dark Mage:''' You be careful with that thing!
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Can you make it hold more than 120 charges?}}
*** '''Player:''' Can you make it hold more than 120 charges?
*** '''Dark Mage:''' Hah! Yes, I can upgrade it to hold 2500 charges, enough to cast Iban's magic 2500 times at monsters or 1250 times at people like you. That'll cost you 400,000 coins.
*** {{topt|cond=If the player has at least 400,000 coins in inventory:|Here's 400,000 coins. Please upgrade the staff.}}
**** {{tmissing}}
*** {{topt|Here's 200,000 coins. Please repair the staff.}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Thanks, I'll bear it in mind.}}
**** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|Thanks, I'll bear it in mind.}}
*** '''Player:''' Thanks, I'll bear it in mind.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I'll leave you to it.}}
** '''Player:''' I'll leave you to it.
** {{tact|end}}

==Staves dialogue==
* {{tcond|If the player doesn't have any [[Iban's staff|Iban's staves]] in inventory:}}
** {{tact|The player [[Jump for Joy|jumps for joy]].}}
** '''Player:''' Staaaaaaaaves!
** '''Dark Mage:''' Traveller, I have no idea what you are talking about. If you want my help with staves, perhaps you should show me one.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has an Iban's staff:|Recharge your Staff of Iban}}
** {{tcond|If the Iban staff has full 120 charges left:}}
*** '''Dark Mage:''' Your staff is already as fully charged as it can go.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has less than 100,000 coins:}}
*** '''Dark Mage:''' I'll want 100,000 coins to recharge the Staff of Iban.
*** {{tact|end}}
** '''Player:''' Can you recharge my Staff of Iban?
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has an Iban's staff:|Upgrade your Staff of Iban}}
** '''Player:''' Can you upgrade my Staff of Iban?
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has a broken Iban's staff:|Repair your broken Staff of Iban}}
** You show the mage your broken staff.
** {{tact|above}}

