{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Player:''' Hello there.
* '''Dark Mage:''' Quiet! You must not break my concentration!
* {{topt|Why not?}}
** '''Player:''' Why not?
** '''Dark Mage:''' Well, if my concentration is broken while keeping this rift open, the results won't be pretty.
** '''Player:''' In what way?
** '''Dark Mage:''' If we are lucky, the heads of anyone within the Abyss will suddenly explode, including us.
** '''Player:''' Err... And if we're unlucky?
** '''Dark Mage:''' If we are unlucky, then the entire universe will begin to fold in upon itself, and all reality as we know it will be annihilated in a single stroke.
** '''Dark Mage:''' So leave me alone!
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|What are you doing here?}}
** '''Player:''' What are you doing here?
** '''Dark Mage:''' Do you mean what am I doing here in the Abyss? Or are you asking me what I consider my ultimate role to be in this voyage that we call life?
** '''Player:''' Err... The first one.
** '''Dark Mage:''' By remaining here and holding this rift open, I am providing a permanent link between normal space and this strange dimension.
** '''Dark Mage:''' As long as my spell remains in effect, we have the capability to teleport into the Abyss.
** '''Dark Mage:''' Now leave me be! I can afford no distraction in my task!
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|I need your help with something.}}
** '''Player:''' I need your help with something.
** '''Dark Mage:''' What? Oh... very well. What did you want?
** {{topt|Can I have another Abyssal book?}}
*** '''Player:''' Can I have another Abyssal book?
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have a free inventory space:}}
**** '''Dark Mage:''' Don't waste my time if you don't have enough free space to take it.
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has a free inventory space:}}
**** '''Dark Mage:''' Here, take it. It is important to pool our research.
**** {{tact|You have been given a book.}}
**** {{tact|other}}
** {{topt|Can I have a new essence pouch?}}
*** '''Player:''' Can I have a new essence pouch?
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have a free inventory space:}}
**** '''Dark Mage:''' Don't waste my time if you don't have enough free space to take it.
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has a free inventory space:}}
**** '''Dark Mage:''' Here. Be more careful with your belongings in future.
**** {{tact|You have been given a pouch.}}
*** {{tcond|If the player already has a [[Colossal pouch]]:}}
**** '''Dark Mage:''' You already have a Colossal Pouch. Are you aware of the dimensional turmoil you can cause by using too many pouches at the same time?
**** '''Dark Mage:''' Now stop wasting my time!
**** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Can you repair my pouches?}}
*** '''Player:''' Can you repair my pouches?
*** '''Dark Mage:''' Fine. A simple transfiguration spell should resolve things for you.
*** '''Player:''' Thanks.
*** '''Dark Mage:''' Now can you leave me alone? I can't keep affording these distractions!
*** {{tact|other}}
** {{topt|Actually, I don't need anything right now.}}
*** '''Player:''' Actually, I don't need anything right now.
*** '''Dark Mage:''' Then go away! Honestly, you have no idea of the pressure I am under. I can't afford any distractions!
*** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|Sorry, I'll go.}}
** '''Player:''' Sorry, I'll go.
** '''Dark Mage:''' Good. I'm attempting to subdue the elemental mechanisms of the universe to my will. Inane chatter from random idiots is not helping me achieve this!
** {{tact|end}}

===When using the right-click repair option===
* {{tcond|If the player has pouches to repair:}}
** {{tact|(The Dark mage repairs your essence pouches.)}}
** '''Dark Mage:''' There, I have repaired your pouches. Now leave me alone. I'm concentrating!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player does not have pouches to repair:}}
** '''Dark Mage:''' You don't seem to have any pouches in need of repair. Leave me alone!
** {{tact|end}}

==Treasure Trails==
===Hard===
* '''Dark Mage:''' Ah! Here you go!
* '''Player:''' What?
* '''Dark Mage:''' I need you to answer this for me.
* {{tact|receives=a challenge scroll}}
* {{tbox|pic=clue scroll (hard) detail.png|The Dark mage has given you a challenge scroll!}}
* {{tact|end}}

===When talked to again===
* '''Dark Mage:''' Please answer the question.
* {{tcond|When given the wrong answer:}}
** '''Dark Mage:''' Stop wasting my time! That is wrong!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|When given the correct answer:}}
** '''Dark Mage:''' Spot on!
** {{tcond|When given another clue scroll:}}
*** {{tbox|pic=Clue scroll (hard) detail.png|The Dark mage has given you another clue scroll!}}
*** {{tact|receives=a [[clue scroll (hard)]]}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|When given a reward casket:}}
*** {{tbox|pic=Reward casket (hard) detail.png|You've obtained a casket!}}
*** {{tact|receives=a [[reward casket (hard)]]}}
*** {{tact|end}}

